<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">AYU - Bible en mashi du Congo</book>
  <para style="toc3">Ayu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ayubu</para>
  <para style="toc1">AYUBU EBITABU BY’OBUMANYE</para>
  <para style="h">Ayubu</para>
  <para style="mt1">AYUBU</para>
  <para style="imt1">Enshokolezi oku bitabu by’obumanye lukere lurhanzi</para>
  <para style="is">EBITABU BY’OBUMANYE</para>
  <para style="ip">Hali bitabu birhanu by’Endagâno ya Mîra biderhwa «Bitabu by’obumanye»: Ecitabu ca Ayubu, ecitabu c’emigani, ecitabu c’omuhanûzi n’ecitabu c’oburhimanya bwa Mwene-Sira. Ebyo bitabu biyêrekana enkengêro nguma nguma zibà n’omu citabu c’ennanga.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ago mandiko g’obumanye galiyôlolosire bwenêne omu bihugo byoshi bya mîra by’ebushoshôkero bw’izùba. Oburhimanya burhali bw’omu mandiko g’e Israheli-Palestina bunakayôrha nka burhashîbirîri ebiyêrekîre idini. Bushîbirira bwenêne ebiyêrekîre eby’en’igulu. Bunashambâle oku muhigo gwa ngasi muntu. Bubà burhimanya bubonekanira omu kalamo kw’omuntu ka ngasi lusiku. Bubà bushinganyanya bwa kulonza okulama bwinjà, bubà bulenga bwa kulera bwinjà.</para>
  <para style="ip">Obo burhimanya bwal’imanyîkîne bwenêne na Bene Israheli. Ebibliya ekunga bwenêne Salomoni muli ebi binwa: Oburhimanya bwa Salomoni bulushire oburhimanya bw’ababurhwa b’ebushoshôkero boshi n’amarhimanya g’e Mîsiri goshi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 4:30-34">2 Bâm 4, 30-34</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Birhali bya kusômeza okubona oku amandiko marhanzi g’oburhimanya bwa Bene Israheli gashushana bwenêne n’amandiko ga balungu bâbo. Abarhimanya b’e Israheli barhashibiriri bwenêne eby’embere bya Bene Israheli. Bashîbirira kulusha omuhigo gwa ngasi muguma. Cikwône Bene Israheli bamanyire ogo muhigo oku burhaba/e bw’idini lya Nyakasane.</para>
  <para style="ip">Oburhimanya boshi emwa Nyamuzinda burhenga, bulya yêne ye bushinga nyanya. Obo burhimanya bwa Nyamuzinda burhajira lugero. Bwo bubonekera omu mukolo gwâge gw’okulema, cikwône mwene omuntu arhankaguyumva (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 28:28">Ayu 28, 28</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Halya amango oburhimanya bushambâla nka muntu. Ahandi bubonekera nka buli muli Nyamuzinda kurhenga ensiku n’amango; bujira omukolo gw’okulema haguma naye (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 8:22-31">Mig 8, 22-31</ref></char>). Ago mandiko gamanyîsa n’okurheganya amafulûlo g’Abapersona muli Nyamuzinda. Obwo bushinganyanya bushushîne bwenêne na Luderho (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1">Ywn 1</ref></char>). Oburhimanya na Luderho byanamanyîsa bwenêne Luderho wacîjiraga muntu, ye Yezu Kristu Nyamuzinda na muntu haguma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Embaka oku luhembo lw’aminjà n’amabî zabalerhera abo barhimanya ntanya nyinji. Ecitabu e’emigani cishambîre ntya oku muhigo gwa ngasi muguma: obushinganyanya kwo kuderha okuli. Ntyo bunakashokolera omuntu omu iragi lya hano igulu. Ecitabu c’oburhimanya bwa Mwene Sira cikunga omuntu murhimanya (<char style="xt"><ref loc="SIR 14:20">Burh 14, 20</ref>; <ref loc="SIR 15:10">15, 10</ref></char>). Cikwône omwandisi w’eco citabu azidohîrwe n’enkengêro z’olufù, amanyire ebicishwêkera kuli ago mango mazinda. Ecitabu c’obushinganyanya cisêgerîze oku «Nyamuzinda alemîre omuntu okurhafà» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="WIS 2:23">Bush 2, 23</ref></char>). Ecitabu c’obushinganyanya cidesire oku enyuma ly’olufù, emyûka y’abashinganyanya yabona iragi n’omuluhûko gurhahwa emwa Nyamuzinda; cikwône banyankola-maligo bàhâbwa obuhane (<char style="xt"><ref loc="WIS 3:1-12">Bush 3, 1-12</ref></char>). Eryo lyo ishuzo lizinda oku idôso linene ly’abashinganyanya ba Israheli oku biyêrekîre obuzinda bw’omuntu.</para>
  <para style="is">Enshokolezi oku citabu c’Ayubu</para>
  <para style="ip">Ecitabu ca Ayubu ebà myandiko minjà bwenêne y’omukolo gw’abantu n’obukenge. Ago mango ga mîra, hàli muntu muguma mwambali wa Nyamuzinda izîno lyâge ye wali Ayubu, àli mwîkubagirwa, anali muntu mugale bwenêne, w’iragi na wa kaboko ka kubêrwa. Obwo Nyamuzinda anaciyêmêrera shetani mpu agend’imurhangula, lyo ahash’ibona erhi ntà mango ankamulahira. Ci kwône Ayubu anabêra mwîkubagirwa emwa Nnâmahanga.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hanaciyìsha bîra basharhu mpu bayish’imurhûliriza muli agwo maganya gâge. Ebi binwa biri bya nshula-mwanzi, bikulikirwe n’akadali kadârhi. Abwo bîra basharhu baganîre kurhi omuntu alyûlwa nk’oku olugero lw’ebijiro byâge lunali hano igulu. Ntyo Ayubu abona marhangulo garhali manyi, ci kwône burhashuba-nyuma alahira okugayîsa Nnâmahanga. Arhamanyiri oku Nyamuzinda agwêrhe obuhashe bw’okulibuza omuntu mwimâna na wa bukenge.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nyamuzinda arhashuzagya Ayubu, bulya omuntu ntà mango ankahêka Omulemi wâge lubanja, bulya agwêrhe obuhashe burhankagerwa. Omu bijiro, Nyamuzinda akalihira balya bantu basharhu bàjisagya Ayubu kadali. Okubundi Nyamuzinda munya-bwonjo ashubimushobôza abâna-rhabana n’abâna-nyere n’ebindi birugu binji bwenêne.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ayubu àli muntu wa misî, àlamire hôfi na bashakulûza ba hôfi n’olubibi lw’e Arabiya n’Edomu, muli eco cishagala mwâli abantu bw’obwîrhonzi n’obumanye na b’irenge linene (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 49:7">Yer 49, 7</ref>; <ref loc="BAR 3:22-23">Bar 3, 22-23</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:8">Abu 8</ref></char>). Ebi Ekleziya erhumanyîsa, kuli kuyêrekana oku Ayubu àli muntu mushinganyanya bwenêne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 14">Eze 14</ref></char>). Owayandikaga eci citabu akolêsize ebyo binwa by’okuherha abantu omu kubà bikubagirwa na ntahuligana omu buyêmêre ciru hankabà amarhangulo ga ngasi lubero omu buyêmêre bwîrhu. Càyandikagwa enyuma ly’okurhenga ebwa kululizibwa e Babeli.</para>
  <para style="ip">Owaciyandikaga, alolereza obwôrhere bw’omuntu ojira aminjà n’olibuzibwa. Ayubu ayêrekîne oku abashinganyanya kulibuzibwa balibuzibwa. Amalibuko ga Ayubu gali marhangulo gw’obuyêmêre bwâge kuli Nyamuzinda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muli ezi nyigîrizo z’aga mafulûlo, owayandikaga eci citabu arhaderhaga ebilushire ebi. Lyo rhumanya kulusha emyanzi n’ebyo binwa, kwàli kwa bulagîrire okumanya bwinjà oku ayishihembwa empingu. Rhurhegesirwe okumanya bici birhumire amababale g’abantu galungine n’amababale ga Yezu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 8:18">Rom 8, 18</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:24">Kol 1, 24</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="iot">EBIRIMWO</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Obwôrhere bwa Ayubu: cigabi <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 1:1-2:13">1, 1—2, 13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Enshambâlo: c. <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 3:1-31:40">3, 1—31, 40</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Amahugûlo ga Elihu: c. <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 32:1-37:24">32, 1—37, 24</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Amashuzo ga Nyamuzinda: c. <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 38:1-42:6">38, 1—42, 6</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">5. Ebinwa bizinda: c. <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 42:7-17">42, 7-17</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1"/>
  <para style="ms1">I. Enshokolezi: obwôrhere bwa Ayubu</para>
  <para style="s1">Shetani arhangula Ayubu 1</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1"/>Omu cihugo c’e Usi, mwabaga muntu muguma izîno lyâge ye: Ayubu, àli mwimâna na mushinganyanya, àrhînyaga Nyamuzinda, arhànakwiriragwa mabî. <verse eid="JOB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2"/>Agwêrhe bâna-nyere basharhu na bâna-rhabana nda. <verse eid="JOB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3"/>Ashwekaga bibuzi bihumbi nda, bihumbi bisharhu bya ngamiya, mahali magana arhanu ga mpanzi, abambali bôhe, kuganja kutuka! Oyo mushamuka, àli wa lukengwa bwenêne omu bantu boshi b’ebushoshôkero bw’izûba. <verse eid="JOB 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4"/>Abagala, bàkomereraga okugend’ijirira olusiku lukulu emwa ngasi muguma mulibwo, barhumize na bâli bâbo oku bali basharhu, mpu bayishe balire bananywêre baguma boshi. <verse eid="JOB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5"/>Byâbà ntyo! Erhi amango g’ensiku nkulu gàbâga gamâhwa, Ayubu anabarhumize mpu bayishe abayôbôle, na ngasi sêzi mucêra-cêra, anarherekêrera ngasi muguma muli bwo, bulya àkagicîzâna anaderha emurhima, erhi: «akanabà abâna bâni bàjizire ecâha, banalogorherera Nyamuzinda omu mirhima yâbo!» Ntyo kwo Ayubu àkâgijira ngasi mango. <verse eid="JOB 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6"/>Lêro lusiku luguma bene Nyamuzinda, bayish’isengera Nyamubâho, omushombanyi Shetani naye, abayisha ekarhî. <verse eid="JOB 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7"/>Nyakasane anacimudôsa, erhi: «Ngahi ohubusire?» Naye, erhi: «Nali geragera omu igulu namânalimala muzûngwe!» <verse eid="JOB 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8"/>Nyakasane amushubirira, erhi: «Ka wabwîne mwambali wâni Ayubu? Ntà muntu omulingânîne omu igulu lyoshi, àli ntagengwa na mushinganyanya, arhînya Nyamuzinda, arhanakwirirwa mabî». <verse eid="JOB 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9"/>Omushombanyi Shetani ashuza, erhi: «Ka busha Ayubu arhînyira Nyamuzinda? <verse eid="JOB 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10"/>“Ka wamanya mpu orhamubaliraga bulà, wacîzongolosa n’oku ishwa lyâge? Wagisha emikolo yâge yoshi, n’amasò g’ebintu byâge gàyôlolosire omu cihugo”. <verse eid="JOB 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11"/>“Ci, orhangilîka okuboko kwâwe, ohume kuli bîra ajira byoshi, okuli we ndahîre, òrhabwîni oku âkulogorhera!”» <verse eid="JOB 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12"/>Nyakasane, abwîra Shetani, erhi: «Ntà burhè! Ebyâge byoshi nkulîkîre-byo. Ci kwône omanye wacîshomya mpu wamulikirakwo okuboko!» Oku bundi, omushombanyi Shetani ayimuka, arhenga aha burhwâli bwa Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="JOB 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13"/>Lêro, lusiku luguma, bagala na bâli ba Ayubu, badwîrhage bàlya, bâna nywa oku irivayi, omu mwa mukulu wâbo, <verse eid="JOB 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14"/>entumwa yanaciyisha eri bwîra Ayubu, erhi: «Waliha, empanzi zâwe zabîre zigwârhirîre okuhinga n’endogomi nazo erhi zidwîrhe zakerera aha burhambi, <verse eid="JOB 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15"/>“kano kânya, empala-magala z’e Seba zamâshagamuka, zamâshûkuza empanzi, bambali bâwe bwoshi, bamàba geza oku bôji bw’engôrho, niene nabafulumusiremwo, bo n’obu nyishire nti nkubwîre na nkumanyise eyo myanzi y’ibala n’empanya”». <verse eid="JOB 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16"/>Oku acidwîrhe aderha ntya, owundi apamuka, aderha, erhi: «Omuliro gwa Nyamuzinda, gwamânamanuka emalunga, gwamâsingônola ebibuzi n’abangere, barhahumirwe ekanwa, niene niene nafulumusire, bwo n’obu ndi kubwîra ogwo mwanzi.» <verse eid="JOB 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17"/>Oku acidwîrhe aganîra ntya, owundi naye y’ono y’ono, erhi: «Abantu b’e Kaldeya bamânayisha bacîgabire muli mirhwe isharhu, bamacirhunika oku ngamiya, bamânazishûkuza, bamânageza bambali bâwe oku bôji bw’engôrho, nienene nabafulumusiremwo, bo n’obu ndikubwîra ogu mwanzi». <verse eid="JOB 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18"/>Oku acidwîrhe aderha ntya, owundi naye y’ono y’ono, aderha, erhi: «Bagala bâwe na bâli bâwe bakazàgilya bananywa idivayi omu mwa mukulu wâbo, <verse eid="JOB 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19"/>lêro empûsi ndârhi yamâpamuka olunda lw’irùngu, yamânacîhônda oku rhuhembe rhw’enyumpa, yamâhirimira oku bâna, barhahumirwe ekanwa. Niene dolodolo nafulumusire, bo n’obu ndi kubânda ezi mpanya». <verse eid="JOB 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20"/>Okubundi, Ayubu àyimuka, asharhula emyambalo yâge, amômwa omukûngu acîrhimba oku idaho, anaciderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21"/>«Narhengaga mushugunu omu nda ya nyâmà na bushugunu nâshubiremwo. Nyamuzinda wampâga, Nyamuzinda onyazire, izîno lyâge likuzibwe!» <verse eid="JOB 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22"/>Muli ogwo munyago goshi, Ayubu arhajiraga câha, arhanalogorheraga omu masù ga Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="JOB 1:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1"/>Olundi lusiku Bene Nyamuzinda bayisha balisengera Nyamubâho, omushombanyi Shetani naye abayishamwo kandi. <verse eid="JOB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2"/>Nyamuzinda, amudôsa, erhi: «Ngahi ohubusire?» Naye erhi: «Nalinjirigêndagula omu igulu namânalirhâmbagira». <verse eid="JOB 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3"/>Nyamuzinda amushubirira, erhi: «ka wabwîne mwambali wâni Ayubu? Ntâye omulingânîne omu igulu lyoshi: muntu ntagengwa na mushinga nyanya, orhînya Nyamuzinda, n’amabî, arhagakîirirwa. Arhankashuba nyuma omu bwimâna bwâge, na busha wamunkozagya kwo mpu mmuzigulule.» <verse eid="JOB 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4"/>Omushombanyi Shetani, erhi: «Aye! oluhù lufà lundi! Ebi omuntu agwêrhe byoshi anabijahike mpu ly’afungira amagala! <verse eid="JOB 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5"/>Ci orhangimulikirakwo okuboko, omuhume oku mubiri n’oku kavuha; we ndahîre! Orhabwîni alogorhera omu masù gâwe!» <verse eid="JOB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6"/>Nyamuzinda abwîra Shetani, erhi: «Jânwa, y’oyo omu maboko gâwe; ci nkukomêrîze, orhahumaga oku buzîne bwâge.» <verse eid="JOB 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7"/>Okubundi omushombanyi Shetani ayimuka, arhenga aha burhwâli bwa Nyamubâho.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:7">Shetani arhulira kwo Ayubu obulema bw’olushomyo, kurhenga omu lushando, kuhika aha ntondo y’irhwe. <verse eid="JOB 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8"/>Ayubu ayanka ehijò akazicîburûsha-mwo anaforhamire omu luvù. <verse eid="JOB 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9"/>Obwo mukâge amubwîra, erhi: «Bici ocînanîrize kwo omu budahemuka? Jâcira oyo Nyamuzinda ncîfîre!» <verse eid="JOB 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10"/>Ayubu amushuza, erhi: «K’odesire nka musirhe! Akabà rhunayankirire ebinja nka ngalo ya Nyamuzinda, cankarhuma rhurhayankirira n’obuhanya ntyo? Muli obwo buhanya bwoshi, Ayubu arhalogorhaga omu kanwa kâge».<verse eid="JOB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11"/>Emyanzi yalanda bwangu, bîra ba Ayubu basharhu bamanya amaligo goshi gamurhogîre. Barhenga ngasi muguma emwâbo: Elifazi w’e Temani, Bildadi w’e Shwahi na Sofari w’e Nâmati, boshi balalizanya, mpu bagendilola kurhi owâbo àbirage, bamulakire banamurhûlirize. <verse eid="JOB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12"/>Oku baciri kuli, mpu bamulikirekwo; amasù, bamuhaba. Bagwîra omulenge. Ngasi muguma asharhula emyambalo yâge, banacigukumulira akatulo oku irhwe.<verse eid="JOB 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13"/>Okubundi bajibwârhala oku idaho aha burhambi bwâge, bahabêra miregerege nda na madufu nda. Ntâye muli bwo washagîre kanwa, bazânwa n’amababale mangana aho.<verse eid="JOB 2:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3"/>
  <para style="ms1">II. Enshambâlo</para>
  <para style="s1">Ayubu ajâcira olusiku àburhagwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1"/>Cazînda Ayubu abûmbûla akanwa, ajâcira olusiku àburhagwa. <verse eid="JOB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2"/>Ayubu arhoza akanwa aderha, erhi:<verse eid="JOB 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3"/>Lukahera olusiku naburhagwamwo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:3">n’obudufu bwaderhaga mpu: «Mwâna-rhabana oyâlîrwe!»<verse eid="JOB 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4"/>Mâshi! mâshi! olwo lusiku lukabà ndunduli,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:4">Nyamuzinda w’enyanya irhondo arhalushibiriraga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:4">n’obulangashane burhacilumolekeraga!<verse eid="JOB 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5"/>Luzikanwe n’obudufu n’endunduli y’olufù,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:5">ecitù cilubwikire, obwîre kabirhi bulubone.<verse eid="JOB 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6"/>Nêci, omwizimya guluhâbwe, lufânande,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:6">lurhaganjiragwa omu nsiku z’omwâka,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:6">lurhajâga omu mubalè gw’emyêzi.<verse eid="JOB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7"/>Obwo budufu bugumbe,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:7">burharhengagamwo na kakù ka mwishîngo!<verse eid="JOB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8"/>Mâshi mâshi luhehêrerwe na balya bahehêrera ensiku,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:8">balya bayishizûsa Leviatani;<verse eid="JOB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9"/>Zihirigirhe enyenyêzi z’omucêracêra gwâbwo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:9">bulangâlire omûshi buguzunguluke!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:9">Burhanabonaga lukula azibûla engohe.<verse eid="JOB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10"/>Obwabulaga kuhamika olûmvi lw’enda nàlimwo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:10">lyo amasù gâni galek’ibona aga maligo.<verse eid="JOB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11"/>Cârhumaga ntafîra omu nda ya nyâmà,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:11">erhi nkacigendera oku nanaburhwa?<verse eid="JOB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12"/>Cârhumaga habà madwî abirhi ganyankirira,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:12">cârhumaga habà mabêre abirhi ganyônsa?<verse eid="JOB 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13"/>Bulya rhinga buno ncîbêrîre omu murhûla,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:13">rhinga ndwîrhe nahûnga irò ntânatulukè,<verse eid="JOB 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14"/>haguma n’abâmi n’abarhambo b’igulu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:14">balya bayubakire omu mpinga,<verse eid="JOB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15"/>nîsi rhinga ncîbêrîre haguma n’abaluzi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:15">bàluzagya amasholo n’enshinda zâbo bazibumba marhale.<verse eid="JOB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16"/>Nîsi, ncicîbêrerage cimomano càbishirwe, rhinga ntahali,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:16">rhinga ncîbêrîre nka balya barhaburhagwa.<verse eid="JOB 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17"/>Eyo munda yo embaka z’ebyâbi zihwêra,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:17">yo abâlikola barhamire baluhûkira.<verse eid="JOB 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18"/>Ebigorogo nabyo binaluhûke,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:18">birhanaciyûmva mulenge gw’owabimokera mpu bikole.<verse eid="JOB 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19"/>Eyo munda abarhò n’abakulu boshi cihembe ciguma, n’omujà arhaciri mujà wa ndi.<verse eid="JOB 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20"/>Omuhanya bici bamuhêra obulangashane,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:20">gwa bici omûka bahà omurhima guli mungo?<verse eid="JOB 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21"/>Ogu bahà abadwîrhe balinga olufù lurhanayisha,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:21">abalulonza kulusha obuhirhi?<verse eid="JOB 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22"/>Abàkacishinzire bacibonaga obudaka bw’enshinda,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:22">bakahamira omu lyânya bacihikaga omu cûsho.<verse eid="JOB 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23"/>Cankarhuma eyo ngalo bayihà omuntu arhanacimanyiri olunda ayêrekîre,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:23">oyu Nyamuzinda agosire.<verse eid="JOB 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24"/>Eyi milumbo n’ebikubi byo bikola biryo byâni,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:24">n’olujamu lwâni kwo ludwîrhe lwadubuka nka mîshi.<verse eid="JOB 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25"/>Ebi nayobohaga byo bino byamanyishira,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:25">n’ebi nakazâg’irhînya byo bino byamantibukirakwo.<verse eid="JOB 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26"/>Kuli nie ntà murhûla, ntà kuluhûka, ntà kugoheka,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 3:26">ntabona irò lya mûshi, ntabona lya budufu erhi kulîbwa n’amagala kurhuma.<verse eid="JOB 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Obulangâlire kuli Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1"/>Oku bundi Elifazi w’e Temani, acîhira eluhya aderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2"/>K’owakubwîra akanwa wankakalinda obu? Ci kwône kurhi omuntu ankabulaga bwaderha! <verse eid="JOB 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3"/>Kengêra oku wahanwîre bantu banji, amaboko gajogonokirwe wakazigahà ensimikiro; <verse eid="JOB 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4"/>ihano lyâwe lyakazizibuhya àbalikola bagwâgwâbira, lyakazizibuhya amadwî galikola gakomanya. <verse eid="JOB 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5"/>Lêro obu olwâwe lwamabimba, w’oyu warhiba olujò, okwenge wamâhikwako, gukolaga mutula n’obwôba! <verse eid="JOB 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6"/>K’orhankacîkubagirage obukûnda-Lulema bwâwe, n’obushinganyanya bw’enjira yâwe, kali bwo bulangâlire bwâwe? <verse eid="JOB 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7"/>Ocîdôse bwinjà: k’okola obwîne omwêru-kwêru aherêrekera? Ngahi wabwîne abashinganyanya baholoka? <verse eid="JOB 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8"/>Nabwîne ebyâhira n’ebyahirûka, ebiru n’ebidukula, abahinga amaligo, bamîre n’amahanya, byo banasârûla. <verse eid="JOB 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9"/>Nyamuzinda akanabarhulirakwo omûka gwâge, banalàngalire, omuhusi gw’oburhè bwâge gwonene gunabahungumule. <verse eid="JOB 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10"/>Omulûmbo gw’entale, omukûngulo gw’ec’erubala, kuhuba guhuba kula amîno g’entale ntò gahôhoka. <verse eid="JOB 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11"/>Entale ekabula eci yalya enafè, n’abâna bâyo bashandabane. <verse eid="JOB 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12"/>Nâni nabwîne nayaganwa bushâla-shâla, nanayumva amarhwîri gâni gahema. <verse eid="JOB 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13"/>Omu ntuliranyè y’ebilôrho, gala mango irò linene ligonza abantu, <verse eid="JOB 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14"/>nayûmva nagurumanwa, nageramwo ogwa nyegenye, orhuvuha rhwâni rhwajuguma. <verse eid="JOB 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15"/>Okubundi ehy’olubohôlolo hyangera ebusû, olôya lwandiko lwashingalala. <verse eid="JOB 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16"/>Oli nka muntu ayimanga, ntamanyiriraga obusù bwâge, ci enshusho yâge yambêra omu masù. Harhengibà akahwenyenye…, buzinda nayumva izù, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17"/>«K’omuntu ankabà mushinganyanya embere za Nyamuzinda? K’omuntu ankabà mwêru-kwêru omu masù gw’Owamulemaga? <verse eid="JOB 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18"/>Ciru Nyamuzinda arhacîkubagira lwoshi bambali bâge, na bamalahika anababonekwo obubî. <verse eid="JOB 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19"/>Ntà buderhe oku bantu bayûbaka muli eri ibumba, abà eciriba câbo cibà cihûmbe omu katulo? Anabasinogole nka nsîrhu; <verse eid="JOB 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20"/>Abanaganukira oku lusiku luguma, abaherêrekera na ntâye wacibakengera. <verse eid="JOB 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21"/>Omugozi gw’ecihando câbo gukonoke, banafè n’okubula oburhimanya».<verse eid="JOB 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1"/>Hamagazagya kwône! Ndi wakushuza?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:1">Ndi warhûla emirenge omu bimâna?<verse eid="JOB 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2"/>We mbwîzire, omungo gunayîrhe ecihwinja,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:2">n’oburhè buzihôkane omusirhe.<verse eid="JOB 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3"/>Yumvagya: niono nabwîne idâga lyayûbaka lyanagandâza,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:3">ci kano kânya, erya nyumpa erhimangag’ihehêrerwa.<verse eid="JOB 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4"/>Abâna bâge barhajira cifungira,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:4">banabayagîrize aha kagombe barhakanabona calîkûza.<verse eid="JOB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5"/>Bakola bahingira abashalye bagera,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:5">bulya ehi bankalîre, Nyamuzinda anabakûlehyo ekanwa,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:5">n’enkonola-masù zirhaciziga bahunga.<verse eid="JOB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6"/>Nanga nkulahirîre, obuhanya burhapamuka omu idaho,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:6">n’omungo gurhamera omu ishwa.<verse eid="JOB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7"/>Omuntu yêne olêrha obubî n’omutula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:7">kula nyakadekere alongereza ecirêre c’emalunga.<verse eid="JOB 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8"/>Ci niehe Nyamuzinda ye nayâkira ho,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:8">mmurhûle olubanja lwâni.<verse eid="JOB 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9"/>Kuhuma ahuma na gombi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:9">ajira omwandu gw’ebirhankamanywa,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:9">ebirhangâzo by’obulenga bwâge birhankaganjwa.<verse eid="JOB 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10"/>Ye dubulira enkuba oku idaho,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:10">arhume amîshi gahulula omu ishwa.<verse eid="JOB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11"/>Akalonza okuzûsa omunyi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:11">okuhisa abarhindibuzibwe oku bucire.<verse eid="JOB 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12"/>Anayeshûle abengûza,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:12">n’emilâli yâbo y’okulyâlyanya ayitamalekwo.<verse eid="JOB 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13"/>Abarhimanya anabagwârhe omu murhego gw’amenge gâbo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:13">atulutûmbye n’abahanûzi bw’okuhanika.<verse eid="JOB 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14"/>Mûshi kalengerêre; babone ekola ndunduli,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:14">izûba liyimanga batûnduze nk’omu budufu.<verse eid="JOB 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15"/>Anayokole omuzamba walenganyire omu kanwa kâbo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:15">n’omukenyi amukûle omu nfune za ciri-misî.<verse eid="JOB 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16"/>Ntyo, owahanyagire anashubiyumva alangâlîre,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:16">n’obulya-nsoro buhumbârhale.<verse eid="JOB 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17"/>Nêci, iragi lyâge omuntu Nyamuzinda ahanûla!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:17">Nâwe orhagayaguzagya obuhanûzi bw’Ogala-byoshi.<verse eid="JOB 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18"/>Ye oyagaza omuntu abul’imubuka ecibànde,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:18">ye obabaza anabul’ifumya n’okuboko kwâge.<verse eid="JOB 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19"/>Kali ndarhu akulikûza omu mababale,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:19">n’obwa kali nda, amabî garhacikuhikekwo.<verse eid="JOB 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20"/>Omu cizombo anakufumye olufù,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:20">n’omu ntambala akulîkûze oku bwôji bw’engôrho.<verse eid="JOB 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21"/>N’obwôji bw’olulimi burhakujire kurhi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:21">wabà muzira-bôba amango omuhaguzi amâyisha.<verse eid="JOB 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22"/>Ecânda n’olubula wabihà ebinioko,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:22">orhanayôbohe ebiryanyi by’en’igulu.<verse eid="JOB 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23"/>Wanywâna n’amabuye g’omu ishwa,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:23">oyinjibane n’eby’erubala biyôna.<verse eid="JOB 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24"/>Wabugâna ecihando câwe cidekerîre,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:24">n’obusò bwâwe, washânga burhahazirimwo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:24">amango wayîsh’iburhandûla,<verse eid="JOB 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25"/>Wabona oku obôloloke bwâwe bwajakwo obundi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:25">n’abâna bâwe bajinirîre nka byâsi by’omu ishwa.<verse eid="JOB 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26"/>Wânâje omu nshinda erhi okola mukulu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:26">nka kula bagumânya olurhyâzo embere ly’akasanzi.<verse eid="JOB 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27"/>Ebyo byoshi wabibwîne! Ko binali ntyo!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 5:27">Nâwe obiyumvagye bwinjà onabikûlemwo obwâwe bunguke.<verse eid="JOB 5:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1"/>Ayubu acîhira eluhya aderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2"/>Acibâga amababale gâni gankagerwa, owalerhaga olugero bankahirakwo amalumwa gâni goshi haguma! <verse eid="JOB 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3"/>Go gankazidoha kulusha omushenyi gw’omu nyanja: co cinarhumire ebinwa byâni bidwîrhe byâhahabuka. <verse eid="JOB 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4"/>Emyampi y’Ogala-byoshi yantulungwîre, yanshâyiremwo, omûka gwâni gudwîrhe gwayubûla obôge bwâyo, n’ebishûgi bya Nyamuzinda nie birhèzire. <verse eid="JOB 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5"/>K’endogomi yakera enamologere ahâli akahasi, erhi enkâfu eyanânge enadwîrhe yakera? <verse eid="JOB 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6"/>K’ebiryo birhabaya izù, byankanalîbwa buzira munyu, k’olwêru lw’iji lurhayôrha nka bidaka ekanwa? <verse eid="JOB 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7"/>Omu bulwâla bwâni, ebiryo by’omulwâla ciru birhandigi oku murhima. <verse eid="JOB 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8"/>Owabonaga oku mpûnyire kubà, na Nyamuzinda anjirire oku ndangâlîre! <verse eid="JOB 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9"/>Yênene ayêmêrage ampinage, azâbûle okuboko kwâge ankuleho! <verse eid="JOB 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10"/>Ciru obwo bwanacibà burhulirize bwâni, nsigalane bishingo bitya muli aga malibuko gâni goshi, mbone ntalabiraga ebinwa by’Omwimâna. <verse eid="JOB 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11"/>Ka ncigwêrhage emisî y’okulinda? Nie muntu nyandikirwe olufù bene olu, bici nacilinga? <verse eid="JOB 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12"/>K’obuzibu bwâni buligi bw’ibâle, n’omubiri gwâni ka ko guligi nka cûma? <verse eid="JOB 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13"/>Ntacigwêrhi burhabâle buci, Ka mîra oburhabâle burhanyâkaga? <verse eid="JOB 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14"/>Okurhabêra omwîra obwonjo, kuli kulahira bwarhînya Ogala-byoshi. <verse eid="JOB 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15"/>Ninyu bene wîrhu ko mwabîre bakarhema-njingo nka mugezi, nka kula omugezi gwanyamûka gugera. <verse eid="JOB 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16"/>Gunayishe gwashalagaza erhi na byâsi biguluzize. <verse eid="JOB 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17"/>Ci erhi omwikalà guyisha, ezâli nyîshi zinagane, zihirigirhe erhi izûba lirhuma <verse eid="JOB 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18"/>Emizinzi y’ababalama erhengâge omu njira mpu yashimba amîshi, ezimêre omu irungu, elinde ehereramwo. <verse eid="JOB 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19"/>Emizinzi y’e Tema ekazizikonolera amasù, n’emirhwe y’e Saba ezilangâlire. <verse eid="JOB 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20"/>Obwikubagire bwâbo kuyishibà kurhebwa; erhi bazihika-ho balole omu ndalo za bene. <verse eid="JOB 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21"/>Kuli nie, ko muli nk’ezo nyîshi mwa kano kasanzi, ene mumbona mwafuduka mwayumva enshonyi. <verse eid="JOB 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22"/>Ka namubwîzire, nti: «Mpî nâni kantu kalebe? Nti mukûle kalugu kalebe oku binyu mukâmpereze? <verse eid="JOB 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23"/>Nti mundikûze omu maboko gw’omubisha, nti ntênzi omu nfune z’omwanzi?» <verse eid="JOB 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24"/>Nyigîrizagyi, nâni nahulika, Nyêrekagi ngahi nahabire. <verse eid="JOB 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25"/>Okuyumvîrhiza enshambâlo eshingânîne kurhagwêrhi mbaka, Ci eyo mirôngwè yinyu kuli kuderha kurhi? <verse eid="JOB 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26"/>Ka binwa byâni mwagayaguza? Ebi bya nyakubula-bulangâlire biyehûkanwe n’empûsi? <verse eid="JOB 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27"/>Murhakashuka bwayêsha enfûzi cigole, Murhakashuka mwaguza omwîra winyu! <verse eid="JOB 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28"/>Ci mâshi yâga ndoliko! Mundole ebusù, ntabesha. <verse eid="JOB 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29"/>Shubîriri, mucij’emurhima buzira bulyâlya, mushube emirhima murhandenganye. <verse eid="JOB 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30"/>Ka hali bulyâlya bundi oku lulimi? Ka ntankayumviza ekanwa ehiri higalu-galu?<verse eid="JOB 6:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1"/>K’akalamo k’omuntu hano igulu garhabà matabâro bulà? K’ensiku zâge arhali kwo ziyôrha nka murhabâzi mulimya? <verse eid="JOB 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2"/>Kulîra omujà acîfinja ahâli ecîhôho kulîra omulimyà alingùza oluhembo lwâge, <verse eid="JOB 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3"/>Kwo nâni nahîrwe emyêzi erhali mwo bunguke buci, n’amadufu g’amalibuko. <verse eid="JOB 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4"/>Erhi najigwîshira, oli: «Owabonaga buca!» Oku nanazûka ntya, oli: «Owabonaga buyira!» n’omurhima gurhandêkerera kuhika buyîre. <verse eid="JOB 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5"/>Omubiri gunyunjwire mivunyu n’ebishisha, guyunjwîre migâku, gwanarhonya masira. <verse eid="JOB 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6"/>Ensiku zâni zo mbidu kulusha entôzo, zànahirigisire buzira kucinnangaliza kantu. <verse eid="JOB 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7"/>Kengèra oku obuzîne bwâni guncili mûka gwône, oku, amasù gâni garhankacigaluka mpu gabone ebinja. <verse eid="JOB 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8"/>Cazînda ntâye wacinshîsha omu libona, amasù gâwe gànanyerekere ntanacihali. <verse eid="JOB 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9"/>Kulîra ecitù cinyamûka cinahirigirhe, ko n’owajîre ekuzimu arhayirhenga. <verse eid="JOB 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10"/>Arhagaluka mpu ashubire omu mwâge, n’aha mwâge harhacimuyishi. <verse eid="JOB 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11"/>Co cirhumire ntakabula bwaderha, naganîra omu mungo gw’omûka gwâni, nnanshambâle omu burhè bw’omurhima gwâni. <verse eid="JOB 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12"/>Ka ndigi nyânja nieki, erhi nîsi ciryanyi c’omu nyânja, mpu bampirekwo abalanzi? <verse eid="JOB 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13"/>Erhi najiderha nti nahûmûkira aha ncingo, nti encingo yâni yabà nka yanyîhiza eminiho, <verse eid="JOB 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14"/>Onanfuduse n’ehilôrho, onkânge n’ebi odwîrhe wanyêreka. <verse eid="JOB 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15"/>Owangolola akampubya, ko kukulu: olufù lwo lukulu kuli aga malibuko! <verse eid="JOB 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16"/>Nashangusire, ntayôrhe mpabà ensiku zoshi; ocinyîrekerage ensiku zâni guli mûka gwonene! <verse eid="JOB 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17"/>Omuntu aligi cici mpu wamushîbirira ntyo, mpu wamuyibuka onamuhirekwo omurhima, <verse eid="JOB 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18"/>Aligi cici mpu wamurhandûla ngasi sêzi mpu wamuhengûza ngasi kasanzi <verse eid="JOB 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19"/>K’orhankalesirage okundolêreza, ciru nâni ntwîre amarhî. <verse eid="JOB 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20"/>Akabâga câha najizire kurhi nakujizire w’oyo, w’ejà abantu bulâbi? Càrhumire wantindibuza ntyâla n’empìmbo zâwe, ciru mbone nkola nkuzidohîre? <verse eid="JOB 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21"/>K’orhankalembera okwo nakugayisize, k’orhankabwikira obwo bubî bwâni? Bulya kandi kasanzi kasungunu erhi nkola ngwîshîre omu katulo, wacinnonza obugane ntacihabà!<verse eid="JOB 7:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Obushinganyanya bwa Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1"/>Bildadi w’e Shwahi, ajà eluhya aderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2"/>Kàli orhanaleke okuderhaderha? Okûla kuderha ebinwa biri nka cihûsi cinene? <verse eid="JOB 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3"/>Ka Nyamuzinda ankahabûla olubanja, ka Nyamubâho ankagolongohya obushinganyanya? <verse eid="JOB 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4"/>Akabà abâna bâwe bàmugayisize, bubî bwâbo ànabahanire <verse eid="JOB 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5"/>Wêhe akabà oli mwêru kwêru na mushinganyanya, olongerezagye Nyamuzinda, oshenge Nyamubâho. <verse eid="JOB 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6"/>Kurhenga buno akushubiza omu bwîra bwâge, anashakâle enyumpa z’omushinganyanya. <verse eid="JOB 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7"/>Obwôrhere bwâwe burhanzi wabulola nka busha, omu kubona obôloloke bukulinzire. <verse eid="JOB 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8"/>Odôkereze àbâli burhanzi, oyumvîrhize bwinjà bici b’îshe bàbwîne. <verse eid="JOB 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9"/>Rhwêhe, injo rhwaciburhagwa, rhurhamanyiri bici, ensiku zîrhu bano igulu ko zirazûka nka cizûngu-zûngu. <verse eid="JOB 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10"/>Bôhe, bakuyigîriza banakubwîrize, n’akanwa kabali emurhima kakumanyisa obu burhimanya: <verse eid="JOB 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11"/>«k’omufinjo gunamere omurhali omu luziba? K’olushasha lwankamera buzira mîshi? <verse eid="JOB 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12"/>Oku luciri lurhò ntyâla, ciru ankabà ntâye olutwire, lwo lurhanga ebindi byâsi okuyûma» <verse eid="JOB 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13"/>Abayibagira Nyamuzinda, kwo bafà ntyo, Obulangâlire bw’enkola-maligo, nabwo ko buhera ntyo. <verse eid="JOB 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14"/>Ebi acîkubagira, buli budodo, n’ebi alangâlira lubà lwôgo lwa lwirhangulira <verse eid="JOB 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15"/>Akayegemera enyumpa yâge, enakûnduke, akayisimikirakwo, enamuhongokane. <verse eid="JOB 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16"/>Lolà oku ayunjwîre magoba amango g’izùba, n’ebyâna byâge byanalândira omu ishwa lyâge. <verse eid="JOB 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17"/>Emizî yâge ezongobarhine oku ibuye, anakazidômera omûka omu karhî k’amabâle. <verse eid="JOB 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18"/>Lêro bamushugula halya àli, halya mwâge bamuhaba, erhi: «rhwembi ngahi?» <verse eid="JOB 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19"/>Lâba oku akola abolera omu njira, n’abâbo badwîrhe babêra idaho. <verse eid="JOB 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20"/>Nanga, Nyamuzinda arhalêkerera Omushinganyanya, arhanarhabâla enkola-maligo. <verse eid="JOB 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21"/>Amasheka ganashubirhûnza amarhama gâwe, n’obusîme bucîyêrekane oku kanwa kâwe. <verse eid="JOB 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22"/>Abashombanyi bâwe enshonyi zibabumbe, n’aha mw’enkola-maligo hashâbwe.<verse eid="JOB 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda arhajisibwa lubanja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1"/>Ayubu erhi akola ashuza aderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2"/>Nêci mmanyire oku kwo binali ntyo: K’omuntu ankayâza Nyamuzinda? <verse eid="JOB 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3"/>Omuntu oderha mpu amujîsa kadali, arhamushuza ciru n’eliguma oku kali cihumbi. <verse eid="JOB 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4"/>Ayishi byoshi, àli na muzibu kulusha byoshi, ndi wankaderha mpu acishingikanye ye abule n’oku abîre? <verse eid="JOB 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5"/>Obagala entondo zirhanamanyiri, anazikundule zikamujira burhè. <verse eid="JOB 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6"/>Anashabagize igulu aha linali, n’ebikondo liyimangirakwo binagere mw’omusisi. <verse eid="JOB 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7"/>Anahakanye izûba mpu lirharhengaga emashinji, n’enyenyêzi azihamikire. <verse eid="JOB 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8"/>Yêne ye walambûlaga amalunga, ye gera oku mîshi g’enyanja. <verse eid="JOB 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9"/>Ye walemaga Ursi na Orioni, Enyenyêzi cirera-mwêzi n’olukere lw’e Mukondwè. <verse eid="JOB 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10"/>Kuhuma ahuma na gombi, ye wajiraga omwandu gw’ebirhankamanywa, ebirhangâzo by’obulenga bwâge birhankaganjwa. <verse eid="JOB 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11"/>Akangera ho ntamubona, anacîgendere ntanatwîri ihuzi-huzi. <verse eid="JOB 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12"/>Erhi ankanyaga omushoko, ndi wankamurhanga? Ndi wankacîshomya mpu amubwîra, erhi: «Bici ebyo ojizire?» <verse eid="JOB 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13"/>Nyamuzinda liguma atulumukirwa, bambali ba Rahabu kuyandala baciyandala aha magulu gâge. <verse eid="JOB 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14"/>Nâni oburhindi bwâni nti nacîhagiza, nti ngwêrhe akanwa nâmubwîra? <verse eid="JOB 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15"/>Ciru ankabîre nyâzize, ntankashuzize, kuyinjibana nankamuyinjibina erhi kwo; bulya ye wantwîra olubanja. <verse eid="JOB 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16"/>N’erhi nakamuyâkûza akashuza, ntacîkêbirwi oku ankayumvîrhiza izù lyâni! <verse eid="JOB 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17"/>Oyu odwîrhe andabarhanyiza obumâma, odwîrhe anyûshûlira ebibânde buzira igwârhiro, <verse eid="JOB 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18"/>orhakaziga ciru namira omûka, analiko anywêsa omutula! <verse eid="JOB 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19"/>Ka kulwa nalwaga? Arhankajîbwa omu irhwe! Ka lubanja najà? Ntâye wankacîshomya mpu amuhira oku ibuye! <verse eid="JOB 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20"/>Nkaderha nti nyâzize, akanwa kâge kanyagiriza, Nkaderha nti ndi mwêru-kwêru, arhâmpè lubanja. <verse eid="JOB 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21"/>Ci kwône, ka ndi mwêru-kwêru? Ciru niene ntacimanyiri! N’oku ndamire kwanshologosire! <verse eid="JOB 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22"/>Bulya kwoshi ko nakuguma, nankudesire: anashenyule omushinganyanya, anashenyule n’enkola-maligo. <verse eid="JOB 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23"/>Erhi ecahira cikali ciyisha, anashekere amagala g’abêru-kwêru. <verse eid="JOB 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24"/>Omu cihugo cigwîre omu nfune z’enkola-maligo anahunye amasû g’abacîranuzi, n’akabà arhali ye, aligi wundi ndi? <verse eid="JOB 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25"/>Ensiku zâni zo mbidu aha mulibisi, zajà zantibamwo buzira kubona iragi. <verse eid="JOB 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26"/>Zikanyize nka bwârho bubidu, Nka kula akadûrha kacîhunika (oku mwâna-goko). <verse eid="JOB 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27"/>Erhi najiderha nti ndeke okuniha, nti mpindule obusù ntùze, <verse eid="JOB 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28"/>nanyumv’ebihamba binshamule erhi kukengêra amaligo gâni goshi kurhuma bulyâla mmanyire oku arhali buhamihami oli wandibuliza. <verse eid="JOB 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29"/>Akabà nie nyazirage, bici nacicîrhamizako? <verse eid="JOB 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30"/>Ka mpu ncîkalabe amîshi g’olubula, mpu nkalabe enfune n’omushenyi mwêru? <verse eid="JOB 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31"/>Kurhahânge orharnvumvuza oku civù, ciru n’emishângi yâni yône embe nshishinyê. <verse eid="JOB 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32"/>Bulya yêhe arhali muntu akâni arhajisibwa kadali, arhanajisibwa lubanja. <verse eid="JOB 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33"/>Ntâye wankarhuja ekarhî mpu arhubwîra olubanja, akaderha mpu arhuhirekwo amaboko. <verse eid="JOB 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34"/>Ntâye waderha mpu ayegûle akarhi kâge kantengekwo, mpu ayegûle ebikângo byâge, bihuse okunjugumya. <verse eid="JOB 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35"/>Ci kwône kurhârhume ntamubwîra buzira bwôba, bulya oku bwâni; ntayôsiri ntyo.<verse eid="JOB 9:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1"/>Bulyâla akalamo kanshologosire, nkolaga naleka omulenge gudubuke, nkolaga naderha omutula gundi emurhima. <verse eid="JOB 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2"/>Nabwîra Nyamuzinda, nti: orhanyagirizagya Muhanyi, ombwîre nâni cici ntumwire. <verse eid="JOB 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3"/>K’obwînage kuli kwinjà oku kugwârhira ecikalarhu? Okûla kugolongohya obushanja bw’omu nfune zâwe? N’okûla kurhabâla ababisha omu mirali yâbo? <verse eid="JOB 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4"/>K’amasû gâwe kwo gàbirage nka bunya-mubiri? Erhi nîsi k’obonaga nka muntu? <verse eid="JOB 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5"/>K’ensiku zâwe kwo zirigi nka za muntu? Erhi nîsi emyâka yâwe kw’egera ak’eyâbo? <verse eid="JOB 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6"/>We dwîrhage walongereza obubî bwâni, wanadôkereza ogwa ecâha câni. <verse eid="JOB 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7"/>Wênene omanyire oku ndi mwêru-kwêru, na ntâye wankankûla omu nfune zâwe! <verse eid="JOB 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8"/>Ndi bushanja bw’enfune zâwe, wêne wandemaga, ka lêro okolaga wanshambûla, onjegenje! <verse eid="JOB 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9"/>Kengêra oku wêne wambumbaga kula babûmba ibûmba, ko wânânanshubize omu katulo. <verse eid="JOB 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10"/>Kàli wêne wankamaga kula bakama amarhà, wanantwîsa kula batwîsa amashanzà? <verse eid="JOB 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11"/>Wanyambika omubiri n’omunyafu, wansobekamwo amavuha n’emisî; <verse eid="JOB 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12"/>Kandi wanshobôza obuzîne, n’obushibirizi bwâwe kuli nie bwo bwarhuma nalama. <verse eid="JOB 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13"/>Ci kwône erhi onambîsire muhako; mmanyire okwo; kwàli n’omu bukengêre bwâwe. <verse eid="JOB 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14"/>Nkakola ebigalu-galu, erhi onandi ebulâbi, na ntâko wankaciderha mpu ndi mwêru-kwêru. <verse eid="JOB 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15"/>Nkabà munya-byâha, erhi namânahera! Nkabà mwêru-kwêru, ciru ntayinamule amalanga, bulyâla ndi muntu enshonyi zibumbire, n’obuhanya bunyunjwîre! <verse eid="JOB 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16"/>Erhi najiderha nti nyinamule irhwe, onampîve kula entale ehìva, erhi kandi oshubinkolera akal’ibala. <verse eid="JOB 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17"/>Nnanyumve oshubirintabâlira, oshub’intûlakwo omujina, engabo z’emicûkà zintêre burhahusa. <verse eid="JOB 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18"/>Lêro càrhumaga ontenza omu nda ya nyâmà, singa nacîfirîre, na nt’îsù lyàkandozire-kwo! <verse eid="JOB 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19"/>Ko nankacîbêrîre nk’orhahabaga, bankûle omu nda ya nyâmà, bampêke omu nshinda. <verse eid="JOB 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20"/>N’ensiku z’akalamo kâni oku zakôfiha wâni! Ocinyîrekerage, mbè nkanarhûlirira. <verse eid="JOB 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21"/>Embere mbalame burhagaluka, omu cihugo c’omwizimya n’endunduli, <verse eid="JOB 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22"/>emunda endunduli n’enshandâle bishûndwa, emunda omûshi guyôrha nka budufu bukulu.<verse eid="JOB 10:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1"/>Oburhimanya bwa Nyamuzinda bwayâgîriza Ayubu <char style="addpn">11 1 Sofari w’e Nâmati aj’eluhya, aderha, erhi:</char> <verse eid="JOB 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2"/>Ka kîshi-derha yêhe arhashuzibwa? K’okuderha bwenêne kwo kuyâza? <verse eid="JOB 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3"/>K’ebinwa byâwe binji-binji binarhumage abandi baduma? Ka warhuhà amasheka n’ebinioko rhubule n’okukuyagîriza? <verse eid="JOB 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4"/>Wanarhoza akanwa erhi: «olugendo lwâni lushôngwire, ndi mwêru-kwêru omu masù gâwe» <verse eid="JOB 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5"/>Ci kwône Nyamuzinda àcilonzagya okukushuza, àcibumbûlaga akanwa mpu akushuze, <verse eid="JOB 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6"/>àcikubohôleraga amahwe gw’oburhimanya, galya gabwîrwa orhagayumve, wali wamanya oku bubî bwâwe Nyamuzinda akutumuzize. <verse eid="JOB 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7"/>K’ocîhâmbîre okusâgarha amahwe ga Nyamuzinda akutumuzize, n’okuyumva bwinjinjà obwimâna bwa Nyamuzinda? <verse eid="JOB 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8"/>Kàli bwo bûli kulusha amalunga, ojirage kurhi obwo? Kàli bwo bûli kulusha okuzimu, omanyâge bici obwo? <verse eid="JOB 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9"/>Bwo bulambûsire kulusha igulu, Bwo na bugali kulusha enyanja. <verse eid="JOB 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10"/>Erhi akapàmuka mpu akola ashwêka igulu n’okulisambisa, ndi ciru wankamurhanga? <verse eid="JOB 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11"/>Bulya yêhe arhahaba owanywerha; ecibî c’omuntu anayôrhe acibwîne arhanaciyibagire. <verse eid="JOB 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12"/>Co cirhumire omusirhe arhegesirwe ahûnûke, n’omuntu oli nka c’ebwêru aka shazimwè, akômere ekà! <verse eid="JOB 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13"/>Mâshi yâga, rhimanya bwinjà kulusha, lambûla amaboko ogayêrekeze enyanya emunda ali. <verse eid="JOB 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14"/>Erhi wankakabulira kuli bwenêne aga maligo gakuli omu nfune, okanaleka kuhandisa obulyâlya omu mwâwe, <verse eid="JOB 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15"/>Ago mango wanayinamula obusù burhalikwo izâbyo, wanazibuha orhanaciyumve bwôba buci. <verse eid="JOB 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16"/>Obuhanya bwakulikwo, orhacibukengêre ciru, n’okabukengêra, erhi kunakola nka kula bakengêra amîshi gàhulwîre. <verse eid="JOB 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17"/>Okubundi akalamo kâwe kashubimoleka kulusha akalengerêre, n’omwizimya guhinduke mucêra-cêra. <verse eid="JOB 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18"/>Wâbà n’omurhûla bulya lêro nâwe okola ogwêrhe obulangâlire, na ciru ankabà zarhanzir’ikubumba, wahûnga bwinjà. <verse eid="JOB 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19"/>Wanaluhûkaga na ntâye wacikuhûgûga, na banji bashub’iyisha bali kusengera. <verse eid="JOB 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20"/>Ci kwône amasù g’endyâlya gohe ganazikîrire, babule aha bayâkira, okulangâlira kwâbo kubè nka ko kukola kurhengamwo omûka.<verse eid="JOB 11:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Oburhimanya bwa Nyamuzinda buciyêrekana kanji-kanji omu kukola emyônè y’obuhashe bwâge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1"/>Ayubu aj’eluhya aderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2"/>Nêci mushâna wâni: munali nk’izù lya lubaga lwoshi, amango mwânafe, n’oburhimanya bunafè. <verse eid="JOB 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3"/>Nâni ngwêrhe obukengêre akinyu, ntâco mundushire muli okwo, na ntâye orhamanyiri ebyo byoshi. <verse eid="JOB 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4"/>Ci kwône omuntu anashekerwe n’omwîra wâge, Mpu kwenge amâbirikira Nyamuzinda mpu amushuze omushinganyanya mwêru-kwêru, gakola masheka bamuhà. <verse eid="JOB 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5"/>Abàbwîne câbugeshera, mpu obuhanya bufè nshuzo, n’owacihûmahûma, mpu bamuholereze. <verse eid="JOB 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6"/>Ago mango erhi n’ab’obuhagwe bacidêkerire omu bihândo byâbo; abasholoshônza Nyamuzinda erhi barhanahuligana, ciru na balya balonza okurhegeka Nyamuzinda! <verse eid="JOB 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7"/>Odôse enkafu zanakubwîra, enyunyi z’emalunga zanakuyigîriza. <verse eid="JOB 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8"/>Ebicibulula oku idaho byanakubwîriza, enfî z’omu nyanja zanakuyigîriza. <verse eid="JOB 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9"/>Bulya muli byo byoshi ntâco cirhamanyiri, oku kuboko kwa Nyamuzinda kwabijiraga byoshi. <verse eid="JOB 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10"/>Abà afùmbasire omu nfune zâge obuzîne bwa ngasi hiyîsa, n’omûka gwa ngasi muntu. <verse eid="JOB 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11"/>K’okurhwîri arhali ko kuyumva ebinwa nka kula olulimi luyumva obununu bw’ebiryo? <verse eid="JOB 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12"/>Abashosi bali ba kurhimanya, n’abakulu bali b’ihano. <verse eid="JOB 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13"/>Yêhe, oburhimanya n’obuhashe, byoshi ye Nnabyo, ihano n’okumanyirira byoshi byâge, <verse eid="JOB 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14"/>Oyu amâshâbira, ntâye wankamuyûbakira, oyu amâshwêka, ntâye wankacimushwêkûla. <verse eid="JOB 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15"/>Erhi ankacîka amîshi, cinashube canda cirî; akagalika, ganayône igulu! <verse eid="JOB 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16"/>Obuzîne n’amakengu ye Nnahyo, omurhebwa n’omurhebanyi, boshi bâge. <verse eid="JOB 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17"/>Abahanûzi anabahabîse olugere, abacîranuzi abasirahye. <verse eid="JOB 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18"/>Anashûhûle abâmi olunigi, abazônze omurhûnda ecibunu. <verse eid="JOB 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19"/>Abadâhwa anabagendêse buzira nkwêrho, ayîmûle n’abayîmire. <verse eid="JOB 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20"/>Anadumye bakishiderha, n’abagula abahabise amakengu. <verse eid="JOB 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21"/>Abaluzi anabalugize amaherhe, na baciri-misî anabashuhûlire olunigi. <verse eid="JOB 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22"/>Enyênga anayinyage omwizimya, n’endunduli ayihindule bulangashane. <verse eid="JOB 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23"/>Anayûshûle amashanja, anabuligaheza, anabè amâlandiza amashanja agal’igaherêrekeza. <verse eid="JOB 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24"/>Abakulu b’ecihugo anabanyage obukengêre, abatulutumbye, baherere omu irungu lirhabamwo njira. <verse eid="JOB 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25"/>Bàdundaguzize omu ndùnduli buzira kamole, badandabagane nka kulya balaluka.<verse eid="JOB 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1"/>Ebyo byoshi, nabibwîne n’amasù gâni, nabiyumva n’aga marhwiri, nanabikirira. <verse eid="JOB 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2"/>Ebi mumanyire nâni byo nyîshi, ntâco mundushire muli okwo. <verse eid="JOB 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3"/>Ci kwône Nyamuzinda ye nâganîza Ngwêrhe binwa byâni nka binga nâbwîra Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="JOB 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4"/>Mw’abo, kusinga musinga ebinwa, muli bafumu ba bwihâmbi. <verse eid="JOB 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5"/>Ndi wankarhang’imununika munahumbârhale, lyoki mwankabona ninyu oburhimanya! <verse eid="JOB 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6"/>Muyumvagye nâni oku nasâmba, murhege okurhwiri, muyumve ecimbà ekanwa! <verse eid="JOB 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7"/>Ka mumanyire mpu mwayâza Nyamuzinda n’obunywesi, erhi binwa bya bulyâlya? <verse eid="JOB 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8"/>Ka mwe mwamuderhera, mubè bafungizi bâge? <verse eid="JOB 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9"/>Ka kurhankabîre kwinjà amuyêshûle? Ka naye ko mwamuha ebinioko kula bashekera omuntu? <verse eid="JOB 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10"/>Arhegimuhana kulya kw’enkwi n’amîshi, kuli obwo bulênzi bwinyu. <verse eid="JOB 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11"/>Ka ciru obukulu bwâge burhamuyôbohya? K’ecôbà câge cirhamuhiramwo cikango? <verse eid="JOB 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12"/>Emigani yinyu mukulûkulù, ebà mihigo y’omu katulo, n’okufûngira omuntu kwinyu, kunali nk’ibûmba lyâlangala. <verse eid="JOB 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13"/>Muhumbârhale, nie nkola naderha, oku byankabà bikubè! <verse eid="JOB 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14"/>Omubiri gwâni ngusêzize n’amîno, omûka gwâni aha nfune ngudwîrhe. <verse eid="JOB 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15"/>Yenè, ankanyîrha anyîrhe: Ci kwône ncîkubagîre okuyêrekana obushinganyanya bwâni omu masù gâge. <verse eid="JOB 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16"/>N’okwo kwône kwânanciza, bulya enkola-maligo erhankacîshomya mpu yayimanga omu masù gâge. <verse eid="JOB 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17"/>Murhege okurhwiri, muyumve ebinwa byâni, muyumve kwinjà ebi ndesire. <verse eid="JOB 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18"/>Nkolaga najà lubanja, erhi nnamanyire oku nyâzize! <verse eid="JOB 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19"/>Ndi olya onjisizagye lubanja? Kano kânya, nyêmîrage mpulike nancifîre! <verse eid="JOB 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20"/>Onyêmêrere bibirhi byône, okubundi ntakacicîfulika embere zâwe: <verse eid="JOB 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21"/>Okuboko kwâwe ombarhuzize okuyêgûle, orhanacinkângaga n’ecôbà câwe. <verse eid="JOB 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22"/>Enyuma z’aho ohire izù enyânya, nâni nakushuza, ci kwône nanga, nie naderha nâwe onyeshûle. <verse eid="JOB 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23"/>Bubî bunganaci na byâha binga nakujirîre? Ombwîre obugoma bwâni, ebyâha byâni? <verse eid="JOB 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24"/>Cirhumire onfulika obusù<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Nyamuzinda afulika obusù bwâge» kuli kuderha oku arhacilônzagya kuyêrekana oku ali munya-bwonjo bunji. </char></note> bwâwe? Cirhumire ondola nka mwânzi wâwe? <verse eid="JOB 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25"/>Bici wakangira ehyàsi hiyehwîrwe n’empûsi? Bici oshimbire ôlukere lwayumûsire? <verse eid="JOB 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26"/>We odwîrhe wantôlera emihigo midârhi, oshubinanganjira obubî najizire omu bûshûke bwâni. <verse eid="JOB 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27"/>We wampizire amagulu omu byûma, we genda wansholera, ojè wasingiriza ngasi aha nagezize olushândo! <verse eid="JOB 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28"/>N’obwo omuntu kw’ashubira omu katulo nka cibolêreza, nka mwambalo gwalîrwe n’enshwa.<verse eid="JOB 13:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1"/>Omuntu erhi aburhwa n’omukazi, alama nsiku nsungunu erhi zinayunjwiîe mirhanyo. <verse eid="JOB 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2"/>Anafunyûke nka bwâso, buzinda ayûme, ayâke nka cintûza burhayimânga! <verse eid="JOB 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3"/>Kàli bene oyo y’onamôlera amasù, oyôla y’odesirage mpu wajîsa lubanja? <verse eid="JOB 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4"/>Ndigi wankarhenza ehinjà omu hibî? Ntâye! <verse eid="JOB 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5"/>Na bulya ensiku zâge ziri ngânje, bulya emyêzi yâge we yigwêrhe, bulya wamutwîrîre olubibi arhankarhaluka, <verse eid="JOB 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6"/>Omurhenzagye kw’amasù omuleke, kuhika naye nka mulimya, ayûkirize omulegerege gwâge. <verse eid="JOB 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7"/>Omurhi gujira obulangâlire, Banagutwe gunashub’ishabuka, gurhanaleke okujakwo emishabuka. <verse eid="JOB 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8"/>Ciru akabà emizî yagwo yàyumire ekuzimu, n’ecisiki cagwo cikola cirhôndire calûndwa, <verse eid="JOB 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9"/>erhi gunayûmva amîshi gunashubimera, gushabuke gunalêrhe amashami nka murhi murhò. <verse eid="JOB 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10"/>Omuntu yêhe akanafà erhi na hoshi aho; erhi mwene omuntu anarhengamwo omûka erhi lwanahûmbire. <verse eid="JOB 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11"/>Olwîshi lunagane luyûme, amîshi g’omu nyânja ganagane? <verse eid="JOB 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12"/>Ci omuntu yêhe halya alambûkire arhankacihazûka, kuhik’aha kuhwa kw’amalunga, arhâcicîzûse, arhacicîkûle omu irò lyâge. <verse eid="JOB 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13"/>Ndi wankabona ônfulika nâni omu kuzimu, ônambêzemwo kuhik’oburhè bwâwe butwîke, onantwîre amango wênene wâshub’inkengera! <verse eid="JOB 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14"/>Omuntu nk’amâfà, k’ankacishubilama? Omu nsiku zâni zoshi nakola, erhi nandwîrhe nâlingûza kuhika ba ntenze. <verse eid="JOB 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15"/>Wanahamagaza nâni nânashuza, wanashub’ilolêreza obushânja bw’amaboko gâwe. <verse eid="JOB 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16"/>Ci bunôla odwîrhe waganja amakano g’amagulu gâni, ka wankabulaga kulolêreza ebyâha byâni? <verse eid="JOB 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17"/>Amabî gâni wagafûnikîre omu cirhimbiri, wanahira obulêmbo bw’ecizibwe oku byâha byâni. <verse eid="JOB 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18"/>Ci aye! Nka kula entondo nayo buzinda ekunduka, nka kula ibuye lirhenga aha lyàmereraga. <verse eid="JOB 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19"/>Nka kula amîshi gahùla amabuye, nka kula ecihônzi cihêka amabuye, ntyo kwo ohirigisa obukengêre bw’omuntu. <verse eid="JOB 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20"/>Wamamurhingamira erhi na boshi aho, amânahûnjuka, onamuheze enshusho ogal’imulika. <verse eid="JOB 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21"/>Abâna bâge bakayishij’irenge, arhankacimanya, bakacinaguzibwa ntâco cacimumanyisa. <verse eid="JOB 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22"/>Malumwa ga mubiri gwâge gwonene ayumva, arhalakira wundi ci magala gâge gônene.<verse eid="JOB 14:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Akanwa ka Ayubu kamuyâgiriza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1"/>Okubundi Elifazi w’e Temani, anacij’eluhya, aderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2"/>K’omurhimanya ankashuza ebinwa byayêhûka nka mpûsi? K’anacibumba enda n’empûsi y’ebushoshôkero bw’izûba? <verse eid="JOB 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3"/>K’anacihagiza n’ebinwa bya busha-busha, n’ebinwa birhagwêrhi makwânane maci? <verse eid="JOB 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4"/>W’oyu wamashereza obwirhôhye, wamagayaguza omuntu warhânya embere za Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="JOB 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5"/>Bulya bubî bwâwe bwo budwîrhe bwakubwiriza ebîra bikuli ekanwa, wanacîshozire iderha ly’enyenge. <verse eid="JOB 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6"/>Akanwa kâwe kwône kakuyâzize<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akanwa kâwe ko kakuyimire olubanja: <char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 18:7">Mig 18, 7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:15">Mat 22, 15</ref></char>.</char></note> ci arhali nie, binwa byâwe binakushobesire. <verse eid="JOB 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7"/>Ka we waburhagwa wa burhangiriza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka we muburhwa murhanzi: <char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 38:4">38, 4</ref>.<ref loc="JOB 38:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 8:25">Mig 8, 25</ref>; <ref loc="SIR 49:16">Burh 49, 16</ref></char>.</char></note> omu bantu? Ka wabusirwe embere ly’orhurhondo? <verse eid="JOB 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8"/>K’okola oyumvîrhe akanwa ka Nyamuzinda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okuyumva amahwe ga Nyamuzinda: <char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 23:18">Yer 23, 18</ref></char>.</char></note>? Ka wênene okola ocîhîre oburhimanya? <verse eid="JOB 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9"/>Bicigi oyishi rhurhishi? Bicigi ôbà omanyire rhunabihabe? <verse eid="JOB 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10"/>Nîrhu rhugwêrhe ekarhî kîrhu abashamuka n’abagula b’emvi, bashosi kulusha sho. <verse eid="JOB 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11"/>K’onabwîne oku kali kantu kanyi oburhûlirize bwa Nyamuzinda kuguma n’ebinwa by’olubohôlolo rhukubwîzire? <verse eid="JOB 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12"/>Cankarhuma omurhima gwâwe gubà burhè ntyâla, na cici cirhumire wamorhola amasù kwa bene okwo. <verse eid="JOB 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13"/>Kurhi Nyamuzinda ye okola obêrîre burhè, n’omu kanwa kâwe mwo mudwîrhe mwarhenga ebinwa bya bene ebyo! <verse eid="JOB 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14"/>Kurhi omuntu ankabà mwêru-kwêru, omwâna w’omukazi mpu naye abâge mushinganyanya? <verse eid="JOB 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15"/>Lolà oku ciru abatagatîfu bâge arhacikubagirabo, n’amalunga garhabà mêru-kwêru omu masù gâge. <verse eid="JOB 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16"/>Kurhi byankabâga oku mugalu-galu n’ow’amabî, oku muntu onywa amabî nka mîshi! <verse eid="JOB 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17"/>Nkolaga nakuyêreka, onyumve, nakuganîrira ebi nabwîne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nakuganîrira ehi nabwîne: <char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 32:10">32, 10</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 36:2">36, 2</ref>; <ref loc="SIR 16:25">Burh 16, 25</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 14:13-14">Iz 14, 13-14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:2">Eze 28, 2</ref></char>.</char></note>, <verse eid="JOB 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18"/>Ebi abirhônzi bàkazâg’iyandika, buzira kubifulika, babiderhe nk’oku b’îshe banabiderhaga, <verse eid="JOB 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19"/>bali balya bàhâbagwa ecihugo nka kashambala, amango barhàli bacibà n’ecigolo ciguma ekarhî kâbo. <verse eid="JOB 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20"/>Ensiku z’omubî zoshi ganabà malibuko, n’omwîsi, emyâka yâge ebà miganje. <verse eid="JOB 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21"/>Amarhwîri gâge garhayumva oburhali bwôba, amango g’omurhûla, kaheza anacirhunike kuli ye. <verse eid="JOB 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22"/>Arhankayêmêra oku acicikûla omu mwizimya, amango amânabona oku akola muntu oyêrekezîbwe engôrho. <verse eid="JOB 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23"/>Amâbona oku àyîsh’ilirwa oku mpinga n’ebihûngu, n’oku obuhanya bwo na bwâge. <verse eid="JOB 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24"/>Ensiku mbî zinamugeze mwo omusisi, ajugume anarhânye, nka kula mwâmi wajà oku matabâro ayôrha. <verse eid="JOB 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25"/>Okuboko kwâge akugêrere Nyamuzinda, acîshomye mpu alwîsa Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="JOB 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26"/>Yêshi amabangalaza igosi, kwenge acîhundikîre empenzi y’amafufu marhumîrira. <verse eid="JOB 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27"/>Yêshi obusù bwâge budwîrhe bwayaga mavurha, n’enda yâge ecibêrîre ya mabwênde. <verse eid="JOB 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28"/>Ali gwêrhe ebishagala ci byâhirigisire, n’enyumpa zirhacibamwo bahi, hôfi zihinduke cirûndo ca mabuye. <verse eid="JOB 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29"/>Arhakacishubigala, obugale bwâge ntaho bwankarhângirira, iburha lyâge lirhakacilumira igulu. <verse eid="JOB 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30"/>Arhakacifuma endunduli, engulumira yamalîra emishabuka yâge, Anahirigirhe n’omûka gw’ekanwa ka Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="JOB 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31"/>Amanye ankacîkubagira omujunja gwâge, bulya kwanashuba kucîrheba. <verse eid="JOB 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32"/>Amashami gagc gayûrha embere amango gahike, na ntà mango gacibishihala. <verse eid="JOB 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33"/>Ayôrha nka lusisi lurhanaciyêra, ayôrha nka muzêti gwamârhoza obwâso. <verse eid="JOB 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34"/>Bulya omurhwe gw’endyâlya gurhajira bunguke buci, na muliro gumalîra omutwî w’emmanja mugalugalu. <verse eid="JOB 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35"/>Osinga obubî anaburhe obuhanya, okucîrheba kukulire omu nda yâge.<verse eid="JOB 15:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Obulyâlya bw’omuntu n’obushinganyanya bwa Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1"/>Okubundi Ayubu anacij’eluhya, aderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2"/>Namâyumva kanji-kanji binwa bya bene ebyo, mweshi muli barhûliriza badârhi! <verse eid="JOB 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3"/>Mangaci mwayûsa ebyôla binwa binyu byakaz’ihehûka nka mpûsi? Ka hali endwâla edwîrhe yakuhahabusa omu kuderha bya bene ebyo. <verse eid="JOB 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4"/>Nâni, nanahasha okushambâla akinyu, acibâga mwe mwâli ahâla ndi; nali namubwîra ebinwa binjinjà na mmudûndire irhwe. <verse eid="JOB 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5"/>Omu kanwa kâni nali namubwîra; nti muzibuhe, na buzinda ncîhûmbire. <verse eid="JOB 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6"/>Nkaderha, okola kurharhûze amalumwa gâni, nkahulika ka lyo gandekaga? <verse eid="JOB 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7"/>Nêci! Lolà oku amamperêrekeza! Wàhungumwîre omulala gwâni, na nâni niono wamaziriringa. <verse eid="JOB 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8"/>Amacijira muhamîrizi, akola anjisa lubanja! Owambêshera amâyanjikira. <verse eid="JOB 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9"/>Obukunizi bwâge bwanyîsire, bunshimbulwîre, adwîrhe aluma amîno erhi nie ntuma, omushombanyi wâni kuli nie adwîrhe agalambula amasù gâge. <verse eid="JOB 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10"/>Badwîrhe banyâshamulira orhunwa rhwâbo, omu kunjacira badwîrhe bampà empî omu marhama, boshi oku banali, bamacizangiza kuli nie. <verse eid="JOB 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11"/>Nyamuzinda anampânyire emw’omuntu mugalu-galu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Emw’omuntu mugalu-galu: <char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 30:9-19">30, 9-19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:13-19">Lul 22, 13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mrk 12, 40</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 2:8">1 Tim 2, 8</ref></char>.</char></note>, amandekêrera omu maboko g’abîsi b’abantu. <verse eid="JOB 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12"/>Nali ncîbêrîre n’omurhûla ci ye wamvungunywîre, angwârhira oku igosi, anacinfûnda omu katulo. Nie nkola itêgwa lyâge <verse eid="JOB 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13"/>emyampi yâge yanzungulusire, yantulungwîre enda buzira bwonjo, amanshambulira endulwè yâni oku idaho. <verse eid="JOB 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14"/>Nie ntumire ayisha ayôkêra-yôkêra, akola ancinagîre-kwo nka mulwî wa ntambala. <verse eid="JOB 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15"/>Oku mubiri gwâni, nahângirekwo sûnzu, n’obusù bwâni nabufûnda omu katulo. <verse eid="JOB 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16"/>Obusù bwâni bwadukulize erhi kulaka kurhuma, n’engohe zâni zirhacibona. <verse eid="JOB 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17"/>Ci kwônene ntà bumînya buli omu nfune zâni, n’omusengero gwâni guli mwêru kwêru<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omusengero mwêru kwêru: <char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 31:1-34">31, 1-34</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 141:2">Lul 141, 2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mrk 12, 40</ref></char>. </char></note>. <verse eid="JOB 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18"/>Omanye wankabîikira omukò gwâni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wankabîikira omukò gwâni: <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 37:26">Murh 37, 26</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 24:7-8">Eze 24, 7-8</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 2:8">1 Tim 2, 8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:6">Maf 16, 6</ref></char>. </char></note>, wâni idaho, n’omulenge gwâni gukaz’isôka burhahusa. <verse eid="JOB 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19"/>Muli ganôla mango gonênè, lolà oku ayiruka empingu, omuhamîrizi wâni, omufungizi wâni omu hantu h’enyanya. <verse eid="JOB 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20"/>Abadwîrhe bandagira n’abîra bâni bayêrekîre emunda Nyamuzinda ali, emunda ali yo amasù gâni gadwîrhe galakira. <verse eid="JOB 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21"/>Aye! Acibâga omuntu ankahash’ijà lubanja<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omuntu ajè lubanja boshi na Nyamuzinda; habè owafungira omuntu embere za Nyamuzinda: <char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 33:23-24">33, 23-24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:1">Ebj 12, 1</ref></char>.</char></note> boshi na Nyamuzinda? Nka kula omuntu ankanaluja boshi n’owâbo muntu! <verse eid="JOB 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22"/>Bulya, emyâka yâni misungunu eyîra yacihwêra, na nkolaga najà muli erya njira, eyi ntankanacigalukamwo.<verse eid="JOB 16:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1"/>Omûka gwamampwêra, ensiku zâni zamâyûrha abambisha bakola bali barheganye. <verse eid="JOB 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2"/>Aye! Acibâga abashekeza abandi barhàli banzongolosire, isù lyâni lyamageza obudufu ekarhî k’ebijâci byâbo. <verse eid="JOB 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3"/>Wêne obâge mufungizi emunda wênene oli, aho ndi wankashûrha omu nfune? <verse eid="JOB 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4"/>Bulya wabafûnisire omurhima balek’ibona ebishingânîne, mâshi orhacizigaga bahima. <verse eid="JOB 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5"/>Aka lebè wajiriraga abîra olusiku lukulu, n’obwo amasù g’abâna bâge gazikire omu mbonyi. <verse eid="JOB 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6"/>Wànjizire mugani gw’amashanja; nie nkola nyakumesherwa ebusù. <verse eid="JOB 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7"/>Isù lyâni lyamahola erhi burhè burhuma n’ebirumbu byâni byoshi ekola nzûngu yonene. <verse eid="JOB 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8"/>Abantu bashinganyanya bamajuguma erhi okola kurhuma n’omushinganyanya amâkunirira omugalugalu. <verse eid="JOB 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9"/>Ci kwône kurhârhume omushinganyanya aleka enjira yâge, oli wa amaboko mêru kwêru anayûshûla oburhwâli. <verse eid="JOB 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10"/>Ci kwônene mw’oyo mweshi yishagi yâga, ka ntacibonage omurhimanya muli mwe? <verse eid="JOB 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11"/>Ensiku zâni zamâyûrha, n’emihigo yâni yafananda, byo byàli biragane by’omurhima gwâni. <verse eid="JOB 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12"/>Obudufu banabujire mûshi, Obulangashane bunajè hôfi ciru hankabà omwizimya! <verse eid="JOB 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13"/>Bici nankacilangâlira, ekuzimu yo na mwâni, omu mwizimya mwo nâtwîra icumbi. <verse eid="JOB 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14"/>Nabwîzire enshinda; nti: «we lârhà» N’emivunyu, nti: «we Nyâmà, we na mwâli wîrhu!» <verse eid="JOB 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15"/>Ngahigi obulangâlire bwâni bucirigi? N’iragi lyâni ndi wankacilimanya? <verse eid="JOB 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16"/>Ka bayandagalira haguma rhwe nabo ekuzimu, nîsi erhi, rhweshi rhuzikire omu katulo?<verse eid="JOB 17:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Oburhè burhali cici embere z’obushinganyanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1"/>Okubundi Bildadi w’e Shwahi, anacijà eluhya, aderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2"/>Mangaci weki waleka ebîrà binwa byâwe? Orhangigerereza buzinda rhubulikubwîra, rhuganîre. <verse eid="JOB 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3"/>Cirhumire odwîrhe warhulola nka nyama, rhwamayôrha nka binganyi omu masù gâwe! <verse eid="JOB 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4"/>We dwîrhe wacibâga erhi burhè burhuma, K’omanyire mpu igulu lyayôrha kwône erhi we rhuma, Ka wamanya mpu ibuye likola lyakûlwa omu bululi bwalyo? <verse eid="JOB 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5"/>Nêci, obulangashane bw’omwîsi bwahirigirha, n’engulumira y’omuliro gwâge erhakacimoleka bundi. <verse eid="JOB 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6"/>Obulangashane bwazima omu nyumpa yâge, itara lyâge lyazimîra enyanya ly’irhwe lyâge. <verse eid="JOB 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7"/>Okulambagira kwâge n’emisî kwahwa, n’ihano lyâge yênene lyo lirhumire akûmba. <verse eid="JOB 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8"/>Bulya amagulu gâge gamâgwârhwa n’emigozi, amâlambagira omu kasira. <verse eid="JOB 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9"/>Omurhego gwamâmugwârhira oku kansisira n’empulula yagwo yamâmusêza. <verse eid="JOB 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10"/>Guli mufulike ekuzimu omugozi gumurhezire, n’omurhego gwamurhuluba guli omu njira yâge. <verse eid="JOB 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11"/>Ngasi lunda ankayêrekera obwôba bwâmugwârha, bunamushimbulwîre oku ajà agenda. <verse eid="JOB 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12"/>Ishali bwo buhane bwâge, n’obuhanya bwamâmuja aha burhambi. <verse eid="JOB 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13"/>Oluhù lw’ebirûmbu byâge loshi lwalîbirwe, ebirûmbu byâge byamalîbwa n’enfula y’olufù. <verse eid="JOB 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14"/>Amâkûlwa omu nyumpa yâge, omu ànalicibêrîre n’omurhûla, akululirwa emwa mwâmi wa bakahèza. <verse eid="JOB 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15"/>Wanahashig’iyûbaka omu nyumpa yâge bulya erhaciri yâge, ecibiriti camâlashirwa aha mwâge. <verse eid="JOB 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16"/>Omu nshishi, emizî yâge yamâyûma, omu nyânya, amashami gâge gamâgokômba. <verse eid="JOB 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17"/>Arhakaciyibukwa hano igulu, arhacigwêrhi izîno omu cihugo. <verse eid="JOB 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18"/>Bamâmurhenza omu bulangashane, amâja omu ndunduli, amâkagwa hanôl’igulu. <verse eid="JOB 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19"/>Arhacigwêrhi ehy’omwîmo, oli ehy’iburha omu lubaga lwâge, ntâye wafulumusire olufù omu lugò lwâge. <verse eid="JOB 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20"/>Omu kubona okwôla ayôsire, abantu b’e Buzika-zûba bamârhemuka. Nabo abantu b’ebuzûka-zûba, bamârhungwa n’obwôba. <verse eid="JOB 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21"/>Kwo habà ntyo, aha mw’enkola-maligo; kwo hayôrha ntyôla aha mw’omuntu orhayishi Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="JOB 18:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Ayubu alengerera omu buyêmêre, ciru ankabà abantu na Nyamuzinda bamulekêrire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1"/>Okubundi Ayubu, anacij’eluhya aderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2"/>Yâgi! Mangaci mwaleka okukazimbabaza omurhima, mwandibuzize n’ebinwa binyu. <verse eid="JOB 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3"/>Lolagi oku bukola bwa kali ikumi obûla mwanjâcira buzira nshonyi mudwîrhe mwandibuza. <verse eid="JOB 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4"/>Akabâga nieki nahabusire, okwôla kuhabuka kwâni nie kuyêrekîre. <verse eid="JOB 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5"/>Akabà mwayumva oku mumpimire, mwanabona oku mwanantenza omu nshonyi zâni, <verse eid="JOB 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6"/>muyôrhe mumanyire oku Nyamuzinda yêne wanyanzire obuhashe bwâni, ye wanziririnzire n’akasirha kâge. <verse eid="JOB 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7"/>Lolà oku ndwîrhe nalonza hajire owayisha rhulwe, na ntâye wanshuza ndwîrhe nayâkûza ci ntâye wanshuza. <verse eid="JOB 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8"/>Anahizire omu njira yâni ecikûnguzo ntankahama, omukâba gwâni anaguyunjuzize mwizimya. <verse eid="JOB 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9"/>Anyazire irenge lyâni, Ampogwîre ishungwè omu irhwe. <verse eid="JOB 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10"/>Amanshambûla empande zoshi, na ncikolera, nka kula bamanyula omurhi, kw’amanywîre obulangâlire bwâni. <verse eid="JOB 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11"/>Anayûsize kuli nie obukunizi bwâge, anakola anganjire omu bashombanyi bâge. <verse eid="JOB 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12"/>Engabo zâge zamâyisha zoshi caligumiza, zamâtwa enjira kuhika emunda ndi, zamâtwa ecihando ebwa nyumpa yâni. <verse eid="JOB 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13"/>Anyegwîre kuli na bene wîrhu boshi, n’abîra bâni banyasire. <verse eid="JOB 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14"/>Abalûngu bâni bahirigisire, n’abîra bâni banyibagîre. <verse eid="JOB 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15"/>Ebigolo by’omu nyumpa yâni, na bambali bâni, badwîrhe bandola nka muntu warhenga kuli, ndi wa bandi bandi omu kulola kwâbo. <verse eid="JOB 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16"/>Ndwîrhe nayâkûza omurhumisi wâni, arhananshuze, ciru omu kanwa kâni nankamuyimbirira kurhi! <verse eid="JOB 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17"/>Mukânie ayâsire akabayo kw’omûka gwâni, abarhurhenga nda nguma rhweshi, mpu ndwîrhe nabaya! <verse eid="JOB 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18"/>Abâna nabo badwîrhe bangayaguza, erhi nakayimânga, banarhondêre banshekera, <verse eid="JOB 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19"/>Abàli bîra bikubagirwa, banyasire, abanarhonyagya bacîyêgwîre kuli nie. <verse eid="JOB 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20"/>Amavuha gâni gakola gananire oku luhù n’oku minyofu yâni, nkola ndwîrhe nacirhabâla n’oluhù lw’amîno gâni. <verse eid="JOB 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21"/>Mbabaliri, mbabaliri, ciru mw’oyo bîra bâni, ebwa kubà okuboko kwa Nyamuzinda kwamponîrekwo. <verse eid="JOB 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22"/>Bici munshimbulwîre kwo mweshi na Nyamuzinda? Ka murhaciyîgurha emyâmâ yâni? <verse eid="JOB 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23"/>Yajeewe! Ndi wankabona ebi binwa byâni byayandikwa? Ndi wankabona bija oku citabu, <verse eid="JOB 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24"/>N’omungwâra gw’ecûma n’olunyerere, bitâkwe okw’ensiku zoshi oku ibuye. <verse eid="JOB 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25"/>Niono mmanyire oku omwihôzi wâni anali Ozîne, n’oku ye wayîsh’iyimanga wa buzinda oku katulo. <verse eid="JOB 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26"/>Kandi buzinda nkola nyimanzire, mbà namâshubira omu luhù lwâni, mbà namâzongwa nalwo, n’omubiri gwâni nayîsh’ibona Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="JOB 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27"/>Nienene namubona amasù gâni gamulolakwo, arhali wundi, ensiko zâni zagera mw’omusisi. <verse eid="JOB 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28"/>Amango muderha mpu: cirhumire rhumushimbulula, mpu rhubwîne muli ye igwârhiro lya kantu kalebe? <verse eid="JOB 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29"/>Mucilangâge oku ngôrho mwenene, bulya obukunizi oku mabî eri ngôrho, ntyo mwanamanya oku ho kubà okutwa olubanja.<verse eid="JOB 19:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Obushinganyanya burhalondôla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1"/>Sofari w’e Nâmati aj’eluhya aderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2"/>Enkengêro zâni zamambwîriza ishuzo, bwo n’obu ndwîrhe nakanâna nti nshuze. <verse eid="JOB 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3"/>Nayumvîrhe ebinwa bimbabazize, Ci obukengêre bwâni bwampwehwerhîze ishuzo, <verse eid="JOB 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4"/>K’orhîshi kurhenga mîra, Kurhenga omuntu ali bano igulu, <verse eid="JOB 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5"/>Oku obushagaluke bw’enkola-maligo bubà bunyi, n’oku amasîma gw’omuntu mubî gabà ga kasanzi kasungunu? <verse eid="JOB 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6"/>Ciru omujunja gwâge gwankalwîra omu lya mazihwa, ciru irhwe lyâge lyankahuma oku bitù, <verse eid="JOB 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7"/>anahirigirhe nka muzimu, abamuyishi mpu «ngahi àjirage?» <verse eid="JOB 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8"/>Anabalale nka cilôrho cirhankakengêrwa, analibirhe nka bilôrha by’omu budufu. <verse eid="JOB 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9"/>Amasù gakomeraga akumubona gamuziguluke, Aha mwâge harhakacimushish’isù! <verse eid="JOB 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10"/>Bagala bâge balyûle amabî àjirîre abakenyi, bagala bâge banalyûla ebirugu byâge; <verse eid="JOB 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11"/>Amavurha gâge gali gayunjwîre misî ya busole: ye n’obusole bwâge, bamâlambama omu katulo. <verse eid="JOB 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12"/>Akaginunirwa n’amabî, Garhahusagya oku lulimi lwâge, <verse eid="JOB 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13"/>Akagigabikirira bwinjà, agagobere ebiraka byâge. <verse eid="JOB 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14"/>Ebyo biryo byâge bikola bibolêreza omu nda yâge, bikola bimuli omu nda nka bôge bwa manjokà-njokà. <verse eid="JOB 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15"/>Kukwânîne ashale amagala àmirangusize, Na Nyamuzinda wamushazago. <verse eid="JOB 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16"/>Anunugusire obôge, Lulimi lw’igû lwamuyîrha. <verse eid="JOB 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17"/>Irhondo arhakacibona emikôndo yahulula, emikôndo y’obûci n’ey’amakafè. <verse eid="JOB 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18"/>Alyûla ebi àlîre, ayihikwe anahongôkwe, kulya àkâg’ibijandâga arhakacikujira bundi. <verse eid="JOB 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19"/>Kulya kubà àshâbîre abakenyi enyumpa anabalibuza, enyumpa aj’azinyaga ahâli h’akuziyûbaka. <verse eid="JOB 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20"/>Bulya àli wa masù, arhànayigurhaga, obugale bwâge burhamulikûze; <verse eid="JOB 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21"/>Bulya ntâye arhalibuzagya omu magene gâge, obwôloloke bwâge burhankarhinda. <verse eid="JOB 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22"/>Oku aciri ajêjêrhwa n’ebirugu, arhemuke n’omusisi, emihimbagulizo y’obuhanya emurhogerekwo <verse eid="JOB 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23"/>Nyamuzinda anamurhogezekwo obukunizi bwâge bunene, anamurhulirekwo obwîre bw’emyampi yâge. <verse eid="JOB 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24"/>Akafuma emirasano y’ebyûma, muherho gwa mulinga gwamurhulûla. <verse eid="JOB 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25"/>Ecisonga camâmuyisha emugongo, ecûma calangashana camâmurhulûngula obudiku, obuhanya bwamâmurhogera, <verse eid="JOB 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26"/>Endunduli zoshi ye zibîkîrwe mpu zimuhûnjukane, Omuliro gurhayâsîbwi na ndi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ogwo muliro, kuli kuderha omulazo gw’enkuba ebànda hirebe erhi lebè.</char></note> gwamâmusingônola, gwamâmalîra na gasi byàli bicimusigalire omu nyumpa. <verse eid="JOB 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27"/>Amalunga gamâmanyîsa obubî bwâge, n’igulu lyamuhindukira. <verse eid="JOB 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28"/>Obugale bwâge bwamâshandâla, bwamâhirigirha omu kasânzi k’obukunizi. <verse eid="JOB 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29"/>Lwo luhembo Nyamuzinda abîkîre enkola-maligo olwo, owahehêrirwe, co cigabi Nyamuzinda amutwira eco!<verse eid="JOB 20:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Ebiri byo biyeshûla owanywerha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1"/>Okubundi Ayubu ashubijà eluhya, aderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2"/>Muyumve! Muyumve akanwa kâni lyo ntûlirira. <verse eid="JOB 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3"/>Muleke ntang’iderha, na hano mbà namâderha, anayishig’ibà go mango musheka. <verse eid="JOB 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4"/>Kuli nie ka muntu warhuma nacîlasa? N’akabà arhali ntyôla, cankarhumaga mbirêmbera? <verse eid="JOB 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5"/>Mundolekwo, mwanageramwo omusisi, muhire okuboko oku kanwa kinyu muhulike. <verse eid="JOB 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6"/>Nka birhànyakwo nieshi nnanyôbôhe; nieshi omusisi gunangeremwo. <verse eid="JOB 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7"/>Cirhuma abantu bîsi balama? Ciru bashosihale banabè ba misî kulusha? <verse eid="JOB 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8"/>Iburha lyâbo linayôloloke eburhambi bwâbo, abinjikulu bâbo banayûshûke erhi banabona. <verse eid="JOB 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9"/>Enyumpa zâbo ziri mw’omurhûla ntà bôba bubagwêrhe, Akarhi ka Nyamuzinda, karhabahikakwo. <verse eid="JOB 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10"/>Empanzi yâbo ngasi mango erhi kubusa yanabusa, n’enkafu zâbo zinaburhe bwinjà zirhamoma. <verse eid="JOB 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11"/>Bakola balîkûla abâna bâbo mpu bajishârha, banagende nka busô, abâna bâbo b’ebirhaba banajè babwadârha. <verse eid="JOB 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12"/>Wanabona bayishe bàyimba erhi banarhimba engoma, baziha n’ennanga, banacisimîsa omu kukaziha akarhêra. <verse eid="JOB 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13"/>Obuzîne bwâbo banabugeze omu murhûla, na caligumiza bacijira ekuzimu. <verse eid="JOB 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14"/>N’obwo bàkazâg’ibwîra Nyamuzinda, mpu: «ciyegûle kuli rhwe, kurharhusimîsizi okumanya enjira zâwe, <verse eid="JOB 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15"/>“Aligi ye ndi Ogala-byoshi, lyo nîrhu rhuhash’imuyemera? Bici rhwankayunguka omu kumuharâmya?”» <verse eid="JOB 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16"/>K’iragi lyâbo lirhali omu nfune zâbo? Ci kwônene orhamanyaga mpu Nyamuzinda ankayumva ihano ly’omugalugalu! <verse eid="JOB 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17"/>Ka ngasi mango kazima akamole k’abantu bagalugalu, Ka ngasi mango obuhanya bubarhîndakwo? Ka ngasi mango abarhumira amalumwa nka luhembo lw’obukunizi bwâge? <verse eid="JOB 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18"/>Ka ko baligî nka hyasi hyayêhûlwa n’empûsî, ka ko bali nka mujimbi gwahêkwa na kalemêra? <verse eid="JOB 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19"/>Ka Nyamuzinda anabikire abâna bâge obuhane bwâge? Yênene ahanagwe ly’ayumva bwinjà. <verse eid="JOB 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20"/>Amasù gâge yêne gabone oku ahanyagala, anywe yênene oku bukunizi bwa Nyakasane! <verse eid="JOB 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21"/>Bulya, bici enyumpa yâge yaciyîsh’imukwanana hano ayûs’ifà, hano omubalè gw’emyâka yâge gubà gwamâheka? <verse eid="JOB 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22"/>Ka Nyamuzinda ye wankayigîriza eby’okumanywa? Kali ye twa emmanja z’abâli enyanya kulusha? <verse eid="JOB 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23"/>Muguma anafè erhi anali n’obugale bwâge bwoshi, abè agwêrhe omurhûla lwoshi, ntà kadûndo. <verse eid="JOB 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24"/>Amabûnda gâge gayunjwîre mashushi, n’omwôngo gw’amavuha gâge gayunjulîre magoba. <verse eid="JOB 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25"/>Owundi anafè erhi n’omungo gumuli emurhima, ebwa kubà ntà mango naye àlabwîre oku iragi. <verse eid="JOB 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26"/>Ci bombi omu katulo banajicihengeka, n’emivunyu ebalûnde. <verse eid="JOB 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27"/>Abà, mmanyire bwinjà enkengêro zinyu, n’ebi mudwîrhe mwarhanya kuli nie. <verse eid="JOB 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28"/>Bulya mudwîrhe mwadôsanya mpu: «ngahi erya nyumpa y’omuluzi erigi?» Ngahi erigi erya nyumpa abîsi bàyubakagamwo? <verse eid="JOB 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29"/>Ka murhadôsagya ababalama? Ka mwahabaga ebimanyîso byâbo? <verse eid="JOB 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30"/>Ali ntya: oku lusiku lw’obuhanya, omwîsi anababalirwe omu mango gw’obukunizi anamanye kurhi ajira. <verse eid="JOB 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31"/>Ndi wankamushobeka oku lugendo lwâge? Na kuli ebi àjizire ndi wankamuha kw’oluhembo? <verse eid="JOB 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32"/>Kuli ye erhi bamuhêka aha nshînda ntya, oku birhôndo hy’ecûsho câge kwo ayigîriza. <verse eid="JOB 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33"/>Amalôngo g’omu kabânda gali malêmbu kuli ye enyuma zâge abantu banayisha bamuyîmizize, n’embere zâge abandi mwandu bamushokolere. <verse eid="JOB 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34"/>Bici mwantulirizakwo, bya busha? Omu mashuzo ginyu harhacisigiri oburhali obwengehushu.<verse eid="JOB 21:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda arhahanira busha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1"/>Okubundi Elifazi w’e Temani anacij’eluhya aderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2"/>K’omuntu ankahash’ibà wa bunguke kuli Nyamuzinda? Nanga, omuntu mwîrhonzi abà wa bunguke kuli ye yênene. <verse eid="JOB 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3"/>Bici kwankakwânana Nyakasane okaba mushinganyanya? Nîsi bici ayunguka okaba mwimâna omu lugendo lwâwe? <verse eid="JOB 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4"/>K’ebwa kubà omukenga kwo kurhumire akulibuza? Ka ko kukusambîsa akolaga ali akusambîsa? <verse eid="JOB 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5"/>K’arhali ebwa kubà obubî bwâwe buli bunene, n’ebigalugalu byâwe biri mwandu? <verse eid="JOB 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6"/>Wàkazâg’inywa ecihango mweshi na bene winyu buzira cirhumire, wakazâgihogola emyambalo y’abâli bashugunu, <verse eid="JOB 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7"/>Orhakag’ihana amîshi gw’okunywa oku muntu orhamire, n’omuntu oshalisire wakaz’imuyîma eci ankalya. <verse eid="JOB 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8"/>Omuntu w’emisî, ye nn’igulu! na barhonyi bali baciyûbakiramwo. <verse eid="JOB 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9"/>Wàkazâg’igalula abakana maboko mûmu wanakazivuna amaboko g’enfûzi. <verse eid="JOB 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10"/>Lolaga ecirhumire ozungulusirwe n’emirhego, n’ecirhumire ebîra by’okuyôbohya bikurhînda kwo caligumiza. <verse eid="JOB 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11"/>Kandi anabà co cirhumire ogu mwizizi gukuhânza kubona, co cirhumire n’agâla mîshi gakumirîra. <verse eid="JOB 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12"/>Nyamuzinda k’arhali omu malunga acîbêra? Lolà irhwêrhwè ly’enyenyêzi, oku liri emalunga wâni! <verse eid="JOB 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13"/>Wàkazâg’iderha, erhi: «bici Nyamuzinda ankamanya kuli okwo? Erhi, ka ankatwa olubanja kurhenga omu citù? <verse eid="JOB 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14"/>Ebitù byanakaz’imubwîkira arhacibone, omwôla karhî k’amalunga mwonene ajà alambagirira.» <verse eid="JOB 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15"/>Kali ocishimbire enjira za mîra, zirya abanya-byâha bàkazâg’igera mwo? <verse eid="JOB 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16"/>Balya bàhirigirhaga embere amango gahike? Balya ebiriba byâbo byàhêkagwa n’olwîshi? <verse eid="JOB 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17"/>Bo balya bàkazâg’ibwîra Nyamuzinda, mpu: «rhurhenge ho! mpu kurhi arhujira Ogala byoshi?» <verse eid="JOB 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18"/>Yêne ye wabumbaga enyumpa zâbo iragi, -amahano g’abîsi gajè kuli na nâni! <verse eid="JOB 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19"/>Abashinganyanya bamâbona bamânacîshinga, n’omuntu mwêru-kwêru amabashekera: <verse eid="JOB 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20"/>Erhi ka barhahungumukaga abashombanyi bîrhu? Erhi ka n’omuliro gurhamirangusagya ebi bâli balesire. <verse eid="JOB 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21"/>Oshubig’iyumvanya mweshi naye, ojire omurhûla; ntyo obunguke bwâwe bwanabà bwinjà. <verse eid="JOB 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22"/>Oyankirire enyigîrizo z’ekanwa kâge, n’ebinwa byâge obibîkire omu murhima gwâwe. <verse eid="JOB 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23"/>Erhi wankashubira emunda Ogala-byoshi ali, wanabona oshub’iyimanga, n’erhi wankarhenza amabî omu nyumpa yâwe, <verse eid="JOB 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24"/>Lêro ahôla, amasholo wanabona okola wakaz’igalola nka katulo n’amasholo g’e Ofiri, ogalole nka rhubuye rhw’omu migezi. <verse eid="JOB 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25"/>Ogala-byoshi anabà yênene ye kola masholo gâwe, na kuli wênene, wanabà n’orhurhondo rhw’enfaranga. <verse eid="JOB 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26"/>Ali ebwa kubà obusîme bwâwe wamabulongereza emwa Ogala-byoshi, wanayînamula obusù bwâwe emunda Nyamuzinda ali. <verse eid="JOB 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27"/>Wamanamusengeraga anakuyûmve, n’emisengero yâwe oyiyikirize emunda ali <verse eid="JOB 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28"/>Erhi wankahiga kantu kalebe, kanakubêra, omu majira gâwe gwoshi mwâbà obulangashane. <verse eid="JOB 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29"/>Bulya anafunye abacîbonyi, acize omwîrhohye! <verse eid="JOB 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30"/>Anayôkole omwêru-kwêru, nâwe wacizibwa n’obwinjà bw’amaboko gâwe.<verse eid="JOB 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda ali kuli, obubî bwamâcitakira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1"/>Okubundi Ayubu anacij’eluhya aderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2"/>Nêci, kuhangaza kwâni kurhumire nalaka ntya, okuboko kwâni kwazidohîrwe n’amalumwa. <verse eid="JOB 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3"/>Ndi wankambwîra ngahi nankamushigâna, mbon’ihika halyâla abêra? <verse eid="JOB 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4"/>Ka nankahash’irhegeka embere zâge nti habè okusâmba, na ntyo nyunjuze ebinwa byâni mirôngwè? <verse eid="JOB 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5"/>Ka nankamanya ebinwa ahash’inshuza, Ka nankayumva ebi ambwîra. <verse eid="JOB 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6"/>Ka binwa bikali ajamwo kadali haguma na nâni? Nanga! Casinga yêne anyumvîrhize konene! <verse eid="JOB 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7"/>Ahôla, mushinganyanya wajà kadali boshi naye: casinga antege oyo wanjisa lubanja! <verse eid="JOB 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8"/>Ci nkaja olunda lw’ebuzûka-zûba, arhayiri, nkaja olunda lw’ebuzika-zûba ntamubone. <verse eid="JOB 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9"/>Ka hali eci adwîrhe ajira olunda lw’emwênè, ntacibwîni. K’àjir’icîfulika olunda lw’e mukondwè, ntamufulûle yo. <verse eid="JOB 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10"/>Ci konene ayishi olugendo njira! Erhi ankantangulira omu cîko cidûlike muliro, nanarhengamwo ncîre nka masholo. <verse eid="JOB 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11"/>Okugulu kwâni kurharhengaga omu mikâba yâge; nakulikire enjira yâge buzira buhabuka. <verse eid="JOB 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12"/>Ntaciyêgûlaga oku marhegeko g’ekanwa kâge, nakazâg’ilanga amarhegeko g’ekanwa kâge omu nda yâni. <verse eid="JOB 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13"/>Ci kwône yêhe ayôsire ampigîre: ndi wankamuncizakwo? Oku omurhima gwâge gulonzize kwo anajira. <verse eid="JOB 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14"/>Bulya oku ahizire kuli nie akuyûkiriza, na kwa bene okola kw’ayôrha ajira. <verse eid="JOB 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15"/>Lolà oku okwo, kwo kurhumire okumubà hôfi kunyôbohize, nkarhanya kuli-kwo, nnanyumve mmuyôbohire. <verse eid="JOB 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16"/>Nyamuzinda anyihize oku murhima gwâni, n’Ogala-byoshi, ànyunjuzize bôba. <verse eid="JOB 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17"/>Bulya arhali emizimya yo enjizire busha ntyâla, arhanali ogûla mwizizi gumbwîsire obusù.<verse eid="JOB 23:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1"/>Cirhumire emw’Ogala-byoshi ntà mango gabà gahanzîbwe, lyo abamuyishi barhagibona ensiku zâge? <verse eid="JOB 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2"/>Banayêgûla olubibi, banayâbula obusò bwazimbagwa, <verse eid="JOB 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3"/>Banahêka endogomi y’enfûzi, enkafu y’omukana banayihâna ishigi. <verse eid="JOB 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4"/>Banasêza abakenyi mpu baj’ikola kulî n’enjira; abanyinyi b’omu cihugo kukola kukâcîfulika. <verse eid="JOB 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5"/>Nka kula endogomi z’omu irungu ziyâbuka, zija zalonza obuhasi omu bulambo obuhasi zahà amanina gâzo. <verse eid="JOB 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6"/>Omu mashwa banagend’ihumbûla budufu, banatwe emizâbîbu y’omwîsi. <verse eid="JOB 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7"/>Hali abageza obudufu bushugunu ebwa kubà barhagwêrhi eci bayambala, ntâco bankacîbwîka amango g’emboho. <verse eid="JOB 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8"/>Olumè lw’omu ntondo, lunabajomye; ebwa kubà barhagwêrhi aha bàyâkira, banacîgonyere ah’ibuye. <verse eid="JOB 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9"/>Abandi banayânke enfûzi oku ibêre lya bannina, banalye abakenyi omwenda. <verse eid="JOB 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10"/>Abâla bayisha bagenda bushugunu, barhanayambirhi cici, omu kushalika banafûmbarha omuhuli; <verse eid="JOB 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11"/>Bamâsimarhira amavurha muli mabuye abirhi, bamâkanda emikenzi, n’enyôrha yamâbul’ibagwârha. <verse eid="JOB 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12"/>Omu ng mwamazûka endûlù z’abayûbaka-mwo omûka gw’àbalibuzîbwe gwamâshekêreza endûlù, na Nyamuzinda arhahuligana kuli ago mabî goshi! <verse eid="JOB 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13"/>Abà bandi bali muli balya bashômba obulangashane, barhayishi enjira zâbo. <verse eid="JOB 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14"/>Mucêracêra, omwîsi anazûke, ayîrhe omukenyi n’olagîrîre, buyîra arhabâle akola ajà azimba. <verse eid="JOB 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15"/>Isù ly’oshungula linakazilingûza oku bwajinga; ntâye wacimbona gwârhi yêne, anacihundika obusù. <verse eid="JOB 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16"/>Abarhalonza okumanya obulangashane, mûshi banalegerere bacîfulisire, <verse eid="JOB 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17"/>Bulya kuli abo, sêzi gwo mango obudufu burhangira, ebwa kubà bayishi ebiyôbohwa omu bulangashane. <verse eid="JOB 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18"/>Ola ali nk’owaj’ayêrêra oku mîshi, aha ayûbaka harharhenga bijâci by’abantu b’omu cihugo, ci ye arhankagera omu njira ejîre ebwa lukoma! <verse eid="JOB 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19"/>Nka kula ecânda ciyumûsa amîshi g’olubula, ntyo ko abanya-byâha banaj’ekuzimu! <verse eid="JOB 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20"/>Ibêre lyàbayonsagya linabayibagire, bamâlîbwa n’emivunyu, barhacimanyikîni, obubî bwamâkenyuka nka murhi. <verse eid="JOB 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21"/>Bàkazâg’ilibuza omukazi w’engûmba olya orhajira mwâna, ntà minjà bàjirîre abakana! <verse eid="JOB 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22"/>Ci olya orhenza abanya-buhashe oku ntebe yâbo n’emisî yâge, oyôla anayimuka, n’abandi barhacicîkubagire okulama. <verse eid="JOB 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23"/>Ali àrhenziribalekera omurhûla, banacîkubagiragwo ci erhi n’amasù gâge yêhe gadwîrhe gabona aha bagera. <verse eid="JOB 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24"/>Bâli barhanzir’ijà enyanya hitya, ci barhaciri ho, bahenangusire, basarûlwa aka abandi bantu boshi; bayumûsire nka marhwêrhwè ga mihuli. <verse eid="JOB 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25"/>Akabà arhali ntyo, ndi waderha mpu kunywerha nywesire? Ndi waderha mpu ebinwa byâni biri bya busha?<verse eid="JOB 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Olwimbo lw’obukuze bwa Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1"/>Okubundi, Bildadi w’e Shwahi anacijà eluhya aderha, erhi:<verse eid="JOB 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2"/>Emwâge oburhegesi n’obôba;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 25:2">yênene ye hira omurhûla omu malunga.<verse eid="JOB 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3"/>Ka emirhwe yâge gurhali mwându?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 25:3">Murhwe guhi gurhabashakwo izûba lyâge?<verse eid="JOB 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4"/>Kurhigi omuntu ankabà mushinganyanya, embere za Nyamuzinda?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 25:4">Kurhigi ankabà mwêru-kwêru oburhwa n’omukazi?<verse eid="JOB 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5"/>Lolà omwêzi gônene, wanabona gutulwire,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 25:5">nazo enyenyêzi zirhaba nyêru-kwêru omu masù gâge.<verse eid="JOB 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6"/>Oku muntu yêhe ka kurhabulikane,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 25:6">Omuntu orhali muntu ci muvunyu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 25:6">gula mushwa mpu mwene omuntu!<verse eid="JOB 25:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1"/>Okubundi Ayubu anacij’eluhya, aderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2"/>Wêne oyîsh’irhabâla omuzamba, wêne onalîkûze okuboko kurhàgwêrhe misî! <verse eid="JOB 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3"/>Wêne wankahash’irhabâla omuntu orhagwêrhi burhimanya! wêne wankayêrekana oku ogwêrhe obukengêre bunji! <verse eid="JOB 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4"/>Ndi obwizire ebyo binwa? Ndi okuhire ogwo mûka gwarhenga muli we? <verse eid="JOB 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5"/>Ebizunguzungu bidwîrhe byarhenga mw’omusisi ekuzimu, kuguma n’amîshi n’ebigabamwo. <verse eid="JOB 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6"/>Okuzimu kuli kubwikûle embere zâge, omuhengere gurhali mufûnike. <verse eid="JOB 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7"/>Olunda lw’emwênè analugalihye buzira cici, n’igulu alimanike oku busha. <verse eid="JOB 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8"/>Anasimârhe amîshi garhenge omu bitù, n’ebitù birhanabereke idako lyâgo. <verse eid="JOB 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9"/>Anayigale obusù bw’Obwâmi bwâge, abubwikire n’ecitù. <verse eid="JOB 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10"/>Atwìre emburûnguse oku mîshi, kuguma n’olubibi lugabânya obulangashane n’omwizimya. <verse eid="JOB 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11"/>Enkingi z’empingu zanahôngoka, zijugurne nk’amâzikankamira. <verse eid="JOB 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12"/>Oku buhashe bwâge enyânja enaberânguke, n’omu kukolêsa obukengêre bwâge ebongêreze Rahabu. <verse eid="JOB 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13"/>Omûka gwâge gunarhume enyânja yarhûlûla, n’okuboko kwâge kwaberangwîre enjoka yàlonzagya okuyâka. <verse eid="JOB 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14"/>Akabà ko bibonekana ntyo, ebya emisigala y’emikolo yâge, ebi rhubona ka birhali buzira nsimiko; ci omukûngulo gw’obuhashe bwâge ndi wankaguyûmva?<verse eid="JOB 26:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Ntabîhaga, ntankanabiha, nyîshi obukulu bwa Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1"/>Ayubu ashubiyûshûla ebinwa byâge aderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2"/>Oku izîno lya Nyamuzinda Ozîne, olya ohakanyire okûmpà olubanja, Oku izîno ly’Ogala-byoshi olya onyunjuzize maganya, <verse eid="JOB 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3"/>Oku nanciyisa omûka, oku Omûka gwa Nyamuzinda gunacibà omu mazûlu gâni, <verse eid="JOB 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4"/>Akanwa kâni ntà mango kànâderhe ebigalu-galu, olulimi lwâni lurhakaderha eby’obunywesi. <verse eid="JOB 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5"/>Zije kuli na nâni enkengêro z’okukubwîra oku oyâzize, kuhika nfè erhi n’omu bwihangânyi nanciba, <verse eid="JOB 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6"/>Narhondîre okucîyûmânyanya ntanakuleke, omurhima gwâni gurhankabona nshonyi ciru n’oku lusiku luguma lw’akalamo kâni. <verse eid="JOB 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7"/>Omushombanyi wâni àjirîrwe kula banajirira omwîsi, n’omwanzi wâni nka muntu, orhajira bushinganyanya! <verse eid="JOB 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8"/>Bulya ngahi buligi obulangâlire bw’omuntu mugalugalu? Hano Nyamuzinda amuhenangula, hano amunyaga omûka gwâge? <verse eid="JOB 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9"/>Ka Nyamuzinda ayumva omulenge gwâge, hano obuhanya bumuyishira? <verse eid="JOB 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10"/>K’amasîma gâge muli Nyamuzinda Ogala-byoshi agakûla? K’anakaziyâkûza Nyamuzinda ngasi mango? <verse eid="JOB 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11"/>Namuyigîriza olugendo lwa Nyamuzinda, ntakabafulika kurhi ajira Ogala-byoshi. <verse eid="JOB 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12"/>Loli oku mwenene mwacibwinire byoshi, bici mwaciyahagirakwo?<verse eid="JOB 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iderha ly’olya Sofari wahehêrîrwe!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13"/>Alagi ecigabi omwîsi abona emwa Nyamuzinda, omwânya baciri-misî babâhwa n’Ogala-byoshi, <verse eid="JOB 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14"/>Nk’agwêrhe bagala bâge banji, onamanye oku oku ngôrho bahwêra, emîmo yâge erhankayigurha mugati <verse eid="JOB 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15"/>Emisigala yâge, nayo lufù lwayigendana, n’abakana bâge barharhoze mulenge. <verse eid="JOB 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16"/>Ciru ankalunda enfaranga nka katulo, ciru ankarhondeka emyambalo ebè nka karhondo k’ibûmba, <verse eid="JOB 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17"/>anarhondeka emishangi n’omushinganyanya ayiyambale, n’enfaranga zâge zibè kashambala ka mwêru-kwêru. <verse eid="JOB 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18"/>Amâyûbaka enyumpa yâge nka ya cishôlero, nka cifùmba ca mulanzi wa mizâbîbu, <verse eid="JOB 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19"/>Omugale anagwîshîre erhi bo na buzinda, anaheneke erhi ananafîre. <verse eid="JOB 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20"/>Obôba bunacîrhunike kuli ye nka mîshi, budufu omuhûsi gunamugêndane. <verse eid="JOB 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21"/>Empûsi y’ebuzûka-zûba enamuyêhûkane ehunjuke; emukûle aha mwâge. <verse eid="JOB 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22"/>Banamuhimbaguliza n’empîmbo buzira bônjo, acihangâne mpu: ekulî eyo akola ayâkira. <verse eid="JOB 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23"/>Ago mango banakoma akagasha erhi ye rhumire, bahebe n’olushungûrho bakola bamukûla aha mwâge.<verse eid="JOB 27:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Oburhimanya burhankahikwakwo na muntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1"/>Okunali enfaranga zijira aha zikûlwa, n’amasholo gajira aha gashûbûkira. <verse eid="JOB 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2"/>Ecûma, ekuzimu cikûlwa, n’amarhale nka gamâjônga ganashube mulinga. <verse eid="JOB 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3"/>Omuntu anahirigise omwizimya, aj’àsâgarha ekuzimu alinde ahika oku ibuye lirhalangala. <verse eid="JOB 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4"/>Banahumbe omwîna kulî n’emyûbako, balya harhankahika magulu ga muntu, banamanamana, bayêrere eyi n’eyi, kulî n’abantu. <verse eid="JOB 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5"/>Igulu, eri lirhengamwo ecijûmbu, Omu ndalâlà, linakâbongoyoka n’omuliro. <verse eid="JOB 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6"/>Amabuye gâlyo gwo bakûla mwo enjuma nyinjinjà, bashimâne mwo n’amasholo. <verse eid="JOB 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7"/>Ikozi lirhayishi enjira y’ahôla, isù lya cigukuma lirhasâg’ihabona. <verse eid="JOB 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8"/>Ensimba z’erubala zirhasâg’ilabarhaho, Entale zirhasâg’ihagera. <verse eid="JOB 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9"/>Omuntu analongerezemwo ibuye ly’obusingo, ahenangule entondo kuhika aha magulu gâyo. <verse eid="JOB 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10"/>Nyamuzinda anakûle nyamwîshi oli aka Nili omu mabuye, n’îsù ly’omuntu libonemwo ngasi biri binjà. <verse eid="JOB 28:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11"/>Amâganya enyîshi, n’ebyâli bifulike byoshi byanabonekana. <verse eid="JOB 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12"/>Ci oburhondekezi bôhe ngahi bwankakûlwa? Ngahi wankabona obukengêre? <verse eid="JOB 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13"/>Barhayishi ecitwîro câbo emw’abantu, ntaho wankabushimâna kuno igulu ly’abantu. <verse eid="JOB 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14"/>Ekuzimu yanaderha, erhi: «Burhaba muli nie» nayo enyânja yanaderha, erhi: «Burhaba eno mwâni» <verse eid="JOB 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15"/>Burhakahinganulwa n’amasholo, burhankagulwa nfaranga, burhankanajirirwa lugero. <verse eid="JOB 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16"/>Burhankagererwa oku masholo ga Ofiri, ciru n’oku johari y’engulo ndârhi nîsi erhi yakuti. <verse eid="JOB 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17"/>Burhankagererwa oku masholo n’oku bilolero by’ebirahuli, burhankagulwa n’akalugu k’amasholo kinjinja. <verse eid="JOB 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18"/>Omanye wankaderha amagerha, enjuma z’enjwijwi n’olubula aha buli, aha omuntu ankaduba erya-nkorôngo, ankaduba oburhondekezi. <verse eid="JOB 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19"/>Enshangabuye y’e Etiyopiya, erhankabugererwako ciru ekalazà, oli amasholo gacîre bwinjinjà garhankahika aha ngulo yâbo! <verse eid="JOB 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20"/>Ci oburhondekezi ngahi burhenga, ngahi obukengêre buyûbaka? <verse eid="JOB 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21"/>Burhaboneka omu masù g’abantu, burhabonwa n’enyunyi z’emalunga. <verse eid="JOB 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22"/>Okuzimu n’olufù binaderhe, erhi: «amarhwîri gîrhu ganayumve babukûnga.» <verse eid="JOB 28:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23"/>Nyamuzinda yêne oyîshi enjira yâbo, yênene oyishi aha buhubuka. <verse eid="JOB 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24"/>Bulya ciru anabone olubibi lw’igulu, ayîshi na ngasi bibà idako ly’amalunga byoshi. <verse eid="JOB 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25"/>Amango ahâga empûsi obuzirho bwâyo, amango àjiriraga amîshi olugero, <verse eid="JOB 28:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26"/>Amango àjiriraga enkuba amarhegeko, n’okuyêreka omukûngulo emunda gwajà, <verse eid="JOB 28:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27"/>Go mango àbubonaga anabumanyîsa, abumanyirira kuhika omu ndalâlà. <verse eid="JOB 28:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28"/>Okubundi anacibwîra mwene omuntu, erhi: «Lolà oku okurhînya Nyamuzinda bwo burhondekezi obwo. n’okuyâka amabî nako, bwo bukengêre obwo.»<verse eid="JOB 28:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29"/>
  <para style="s1">Emirenge n’ebîtakiro by’Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1"/>Ayubu anaciyûshûla ebinwa byâge omu migani, aderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2"/>Ndi wankacinshubiza aha nali omu myâka ya mîra? Amango Nyamuzinda àcînangaga. <verse eid="JOB 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3"/>Amango àkazâg’imoleka n’itara lyâge ah’irhwe lyâni, n’obumoleke bwâge bwanyêreka enjira omu mwizimya. <verse eid="JOB 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4"/>Kurhi nankacihash’ibona ensiku nâlimwo mugale? Amango Nyamuzinda àkazâg’iyisha alilânga enyumpa yâni? <verse eid="JOB 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5"/>Gàli mango Ogala-Byoshi àciri haguma nâni, n’amango abâna bâni bâli banzungulusire; <verse eid="JOB 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6"/>Mango amagulu gâni, gàkazâg’ishukirwa omu mpyûhyu, n’amavurha gàkazâg’ihulula omu mishôndo y’amabuye! <verse eid="JOB 29:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7"/>Erhi nankahulusire omu muhanda gw’olugo, Nîsi erhi nankahizire entebe yâni aha ngômbe, <verse eid="JOB 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8"/>Omu kunângira, abâna b’emisole bàkagicîyêgûla, abashosi banayîmuka bacîlange n’obukenge. <verse eid="JOB 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9"/>Abarhambo bàkagihwêkera batwe omu binwa byâbo, bànakagihira okuboko oku kanwa. <verse eid="JOB 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10"/>Izù ly’abarhegesi lyàkaginyiha, n’olulimi lwâbo lugokômbere ebiraka. <verse eid="JOB 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11"/>Owakàg’iyumva anarhangâle, ngasi muntu wahashire okundikira kw’isù anamwêmwêrhwa erhi nie ntuma. <verse eid="JOB 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12"/>Bulya nakâg’irhabâla omukenyi orhagwêrhi câkalisa, n’enfûzi erhagwêrhi aha yankasimikira. <verse eid="JOB 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13"/>Obwânga bw’abâli omu kâga k’okufà, bwàkâg’ijà emunda ndi, nanakagishubiza obushagaluke omu murhima gw’omukana. <verse eid="JOB 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14"/>Nakazicîhûndikira obushinganyanya nka mwambalo gwâni, nalingwêrhe obugula nka cishûli nacîhundikiraga, na nka cimanè c’oku irhwe. <verse eid="JOB 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15"/>Nalinkola nie masù g’omuhûrha, na magulu g’ecirema! <verse eid="JOB 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16"/>Nie nali îshe w’abakenyi, mufungizi w’ebigolo nakazibaderhera <verse eid="JOB 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17"/>Nakazivungunyula emyânganga y’omuntu mubî n’omu mîno gâge mpângamule mw’omunyago gwâge. <verse eid="JOB 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18"/>Nakaz’iderha, nti: «nayîsh’ifà na ndi muli er’irhûnda lyâni, erhi namânayûsa nsiku nyinji ziri nka za mushênyi» <verse eid="JOB 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19"/>Emizî yâni ekazihika oku lwîshi, n’olumè lw’obudufu lukazigwa oku lwasi lwâni. <verse eid="JOB 29:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20"/>Irenge lyâni lyakazibà lihyâhya ngasi mango, n’omuherho gundi omu nfune gwashubishâshuka. <verse eid="JOB 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21"/>Banakaziyumvirhiza ebi naderha erhi bananêmbire buzira kurhama, banahwekêre lyo bayumvîrhiza amahano gâni. <verse eid="JOB 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22"/>Erhi nankacîshomize okuderha, ntâye wankacicîshomya mpu ashuza kundikundi, n’ebinwa byâni byakaz’ibarhogerako bunyibunyi. <verse eid="JOB 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23"/>Bàkagininda nka kula balingûza enkuba ehângamire, bayashamule akanwa nk’abalingûza omurhonyi gwamâlegama. <verse eid="JOB 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24"/>Erhi namwemwerheragwa embere zâbo, boshi banarhangâle, bakaziyankirira n’obuzigire ngasi cimanyîso ca buzigire c’omu busù bwâni. <verse eid="JOB 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25"/>Nienene nàli cirongôzi c’enjira bakulikira, nka kula mwâmi abwârhala ekarhî kâbo, nakaziyôrha nk’owarhûliriza abâli omu mishîbo.<verse eid="JOB 29:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1"/>Na bunôla, lêro nkolaga masheka g’entindi kundusha, abà nakazâg’ibona b’îshe wâbo bali bagaraganda bwenêne, balya ciru ntankahirîre ebiryo omu mulânga gw’ebibwa byâni. <verse eid="JOB 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2"/>Ciru n’emisî y’amaboko gâbo ntâbyo yankànkwânine, bàlikorôsire okw’ibonya-nshonyi. <verse eid="JOB 30:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3"/>Barhàcigwêrhe nyama oku mibiri yâbo erhi cizombo cikali cirhuma, bakazikugurha emizî y’amadirha, bakazirya obuhasi bw’oku côlezo. <verse eid="JOB 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4"/>Bakazihumbula engâka omu makerêrhè, n’obûntu bwâbo bwakazirhenga omu mizî y’ensinzi <verse eid="JOB 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5"/>Bâli bamâlibirhwako n’abandi omu cihugo, bàkazâg’ibashekera nka bishambo, <verse eid="JOB 30:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6"/>Bàkazâg’ihanda omu mânga z’embyà, omu nkunda erhi omu nyâla z’amabuye. <verse eid="JOB 30:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7"/>Bakola bajalumbira omu mashaka nka ndogomi, n’okulundumana omu marhàdu, <verse eid="JOB 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8"/>Bâna ba nshâhu na kulusha, balume barhajira izîno, bàcibêrire bakage omu cihugo. <verse eid="JOB 30:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9"/>Lêro muli zino nsiku, nie bakola badwîrhe lwimbo, nie nkola mugani gwâbo. <verse eid="JOB 30:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10"/>Omu kubashologorha, banakazînyâka, barhanacirhînya okummeshera emalanga. <verse eid="JOB 30:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11"/>Na bulya yêne warhumire olugè lw’omuherho gwâni lwadaga, ye wanancôcôbize, bakola bakanegenera omu masù gâni. <verse eid="JOB 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12"/>Bakolaga bayishilola oku bansholoshônza, balole erhi nafukunya, okubundi bangereze mu nsânya. <verse eid="JOB 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13"/>Bakola banfukira amâjira, babonereho igwârhiro ly’okumperêrekeza, na ntâye wabacîka. <verse eid="JOB 30:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14"/>Bakola badâha omu mwwâni nk’owagera omu murhule mugali gw’omu lukânga, bangendegendeko lugali bansige omu bigukà. <verse eid="JOB 30:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15"/>Ecôbà campindukîre, irhûnda lyâni lyayêhûka nka mpûsi, n’obulangâlire bwâni bwagera nka bitù. <verse eid="JOB 30:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16"/>Na bunôla, akalamo ngwêrhe kalêmbire, ensiku z’amaganya zamandibuza. <verse eid="JOB 30:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17"/>Budufu nanyumve amavuha garhaciri gâni, n’abandyagâsa barhahûnga. <verse eid="JOB 30:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18"/>Yêne ongwârhîre omu mwambalo n’emisî yâge yoshi, kusêgeza oku mishumi y’ecirondo câni. <verse eid="JOB 30:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19"/>Ankwêbire omu byôndo, nkola nshushire akatulo n’oluvû. <verse eid="JOB 30:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20"/>Ndwîrhe nakuyâkûza orhananshuza, nyimanzire embere zâwe orhanandola îsù. <verse eid="JOB 30:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21"/>Wàhindusire mwîsi kuli nie, okuboko kwâwe kudârhi kudwîrhe kwandibuza. <verse eid="JOB 30:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22"/>Wamankwêba emalunga mpu empûsi embone, mpu lyo nzikanwa n’omulaba? <verse eid="JOB 30:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23"/>Nêci mmanyire oku okola onyêrekîze ebwa lufù, era munda abantu boshi bashimânana. <verse eid="JOB 30:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24"/>Ci kwône, ka nkola nenganyize omukenyi, amango ali omu maganya anadwîrhe ahûna ecàfûngira? <verse eid="JOB 30:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25"/>Ka niono ntafaga bônjo, ngasi walilamire kubî? Ka ntayêrekanaga olukogo oku mugaraganda. <verse eid="JOB 30:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26"/>Nakagilangâlira iragi, lêro obuhanya bwantogera, Nakazilingûza obulangashane, lêro gwabà mwizimya gucîyêrekana. <verse eid="JOB 30:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27"/>Nangôngo akola andibuza burhahusa, Ensiku z’amalibuko zànzidohîre. <verse eid="JOB 30:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28"/>Nkahuluka n’obusù buzinzibire, ntâye ontuliriza, omu karhî k’olubaga nkaderha nti nyimuke, erhi kunakola kumpà olwôho! <verse eid="JOB 30:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29"/>Banyambwe bàhindusire bene wîrhu, n’omulungu wâni akola ye cigukuma. <verse eid="JOB 30:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30"/>Omubiri gwâni gwahihire, amavuha gâni gayumûsire. <verse eid="JOB 30:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31"/>Olulanga lwâni lukola lulongêrera kuyimba mishîbo, akarhêra kâni oku mulênge gwa ba-nyamulakà.<verse eid="JOB 30:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31"/>
  <para style="s1">Ayubu ahûna mpu Nnâmahanga yênene amutwirage olubanja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1"/>Nali erhi nalaganyire oku amasù gâni, ntà mango ganacilole oku mwâna-nyere. <verse eid="JOB 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2"/>Lêro luhembo luci Nyamuzinda ankacijira kurhenga enyanya, ngalo ehi Ogala-byoshi ashobôza omu mpingu? <verse eid="JOB 31:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3"/>Ka burhali buhanya abîkira endyâlya, n’entanya oku bantu bakola amaligo? <verse eid="JOB 31:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4"/>K’arhadwîrhi abona olugendo lwâni, nîsi k’arhaganja amakano njira n’aga ndîka? <verse eid="JOB 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5"/>Ka nkola njîre omu njira mbî, K’okugulu kwâni kwalibirhîre omu burhebanyi? <verse eid="JOB 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6"/>Angererage oku lugero lukwîrîre, Nyamuzinda yênene amanyirira oku ndi mwêru-kwêru <verse eid="JOB 31:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7"/>Akabà enjira yâni erhenzire omu njira nnungêdu, akabà omurhima gwâni gwahûsire n’amasù gâni, akabà enfune zâni zàzinzire na bubî bulebe, <verse eid="JOB 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8"/>mâshi, mbô rhwêra emburho n’owundi azirye, mâshi, emishebuka yâni emânyulwe erhi nanciri murhò. <verse eid="JOB 31:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9"/>Akabà omurhima gwâni gwajîre gwâlehya omukazi, Akabà nkola njîre nayunjayunja oku lumvi lwa mulungu wâni, <verse eid="JOB 31:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10"/>mâshi mukânie abonishwêra abandi, mâshi abandi bamurhize banamuyanke! <verse eid="JOB 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11"/>Buhanya bwankarhuma mpâbwa obuhane, n’owantwira olubanja, bulya ebyo byoshi kunali kuhemuka omu bubî. <verse eid="JOB 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12"/>Kwankabire kuciyakiza omuliro gwa Kaheza w’ekuzimu, n’okucîyôkera nienene omuhako gwâni gwoshi. <verse eid="JOB 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13"/>Akabà nalyalyanyize mwambali wâni erhi mwambalikazi wâni, erhi nabula okuhemba nk’oku binali? <verse eid="JOB 31:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14"/>Kurhi nankayîsh’ijira hano Nyamuzinda apamuka? Hano aj’emulondôlo gwa ngasi byàbîre, kurhi nâshuza? <verse eid="JOB 31:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15"/>Owandemaga kurhenga omu nda ya nyâmà, K’arhali ye wabalemaga boki? Nêci ali Nyamuzinda muguma warhulemaga rhweshi kurhenga omu nda za banyâmà <verse eid="JOB 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16"/>Ka nabuzire buyumvîrhiza omusengero gw’omukenyi, Ka nalesire amasù g’omukana gàhenenuka konene? <verse eid="JOB 31:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17"/>Ka nalîre olwîko lwâni nienene, buzira kulugabâna n’enfûzi? <verse eid="JOB 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18"/>N’obwo kurhenga eburhò, Nyamuzinda àkagindera nka lârhà, akazinshokolana kurhenga aha cânjo. <verse eid="JOB 31:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19"/>Ka nabwîne omukenyi orhagwêrhi eci ayambala, olya w’obuligo orhagwêrhi eci acîbwîka. <verse eid="JOB 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20"/>Buzira kusûhirwa obwangà bwarhenga emurhima gwâbo, buzira kubwikwa n’amôya g’ebibuzi byâni? <verse eid="JOB 31:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21"/>Ka nkola nnambwîre okuboko nti nkômole mw’akantu k’enfûzi? Bulya mmanyire ntâye wankantângira oku lumvi? <verse eid="JOB 31:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22"/>Mâshi ecirhugo câni cinahaguke oku igosi lyâni, n’okuboko kwâni kutwikire aha ngafula! <verse eid="JOB 31:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23"/>Bulya obuhanya bwa Nyamuzinda bwanarhibukira kuli nie, Ntankanacihash’ibêra embere z’obukulu bwâge. <verse eid="JOB 31:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24"/>Ka nahira obwikubagire bwâni omu masholo, n’okubwîra isholo licire, nti: «We Nyamwegemerwa wâni?» <verse eid="JOB 31:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25"/>Ka nacîsîmîsa n’ebirugu binji njira, n’obuhirhi nafulusagya omu maboko gâni? <verse eid="JOB 31:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26"/>Omu kulangîra izûba omu bumoleke bwâlyo, Omwêzi omu lugendo lw’obwinjà gubashamwo; <verse eid="JOB 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27"/>K’omurhima gwâni omu lwihwêko lw’entimanya, gwashumikwa mpu guhire okuboko oku kanwa gubinûnugurhe? <verse eid="JOB 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28"/>Kandi bwankabîre buhanya bwa câha, bulya erhi namâhakana Nyamuzinda mukulu bwenêne. <verse eid="JOB 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29"/>Ka nasîmire bulya obuhanya bwamârhogera omushombanyi wâni? Ka nacîshinga bulya obuhanya bwamâmuhandira? <verse eid="JOB 31:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30"/>Nie ntàyêmêraga olulimi lwâni lwalogorha, Ntankahûna nti abè buligo omu kalamo kâge. <verse eid="JOB 31:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31"/>K’abantu b’omu côgo câni, barhaciderheraga mpu: «Muntu ndi arhayigusagya n’okulya enyama?» <verse eid="JOB 31:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32"/>Ntà cigolo càbuzire aha cahanda, aha mwâni olumvi lwakaz’iyôrha luli luyigule oku babalama. <verse eid="JOB 31:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33"/>Ka nafulisire amabî gâni embere z’abantu? Ka nabikirira obubî omu murhima gwâni? <verse eid="JOB 31:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34"/>Ka nayôboha amasheka g’abagera, K’obwôba bw’okugayaguzibwa n’emilala y’abalungu bwambulîsa omurhûla? Kuhika nacîyigalira omu mwâni erhi kurhînya okuhuluka kurhuma? <verse eid="JOB 31:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35"/>Yoo! Lêro ndi wankarhuma banyumva? Nadesire akanwa kâni kazinda: Nyamuzinda Ogala-byoshi anyagîrize! Olya onshìmbire aderhage ecitumulo c’amabî gâni. <verse eid="JOB 31:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36"/>Nyêmîre ncihagarhire aha lurhugo, nciyambâle ecibunu nka ishungwè. <verse eid="JOB 31:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37"/>Nayishimuyêreka omwîgasho gwâni muli ngasi kashândo, na nyegere emunda ali buzira bôba nka muluzi. <verse eid="JOB 31:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38"/>Akabà obudaka bwâni bwankampêka lubanja n’emigâku yâbo elake haguma nabo, <verse eid="JOB 31:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39"/>Akabà nalîremwo omwâka gw’omuntu buzira kutumûla akabà nayîsire bene obudaka bwâbo? <verse eid="JOB 31:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40"/>Mâshi mbone emishûgi emere muli lyo ahâli h’engano, erhi mumere ebyâsi birhaj’ekanwa, bya kabayo. Byahwêra aho ebinwa by’Ayubu.<verse eid="JOB 31:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32"/>
  <para style="ms1">III. Amahugûlo ga Elihu</para>
  <para style="s1">Ebinwa bya Elibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1"/>Abo bantu basharhu barhacishûbiriraga bashuza Ayubu bulya àli acîbona mushinganyanya kulusha. <verse eid="JOB 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2"/>Lêro oburhè bunene bwanacigwârha Elihu, mwene Barakeli muburhwa w’e Buzi w’omu mulala gwa Rama, akalihira Ayubu bwenêne kulya kubà Ayubu àcikungaga okuyâza Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="JOB 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3"/>Kandi akunirira balya bîra bâge basharhu ebwa kubà barhacishuzagya Ayubu, ciru n’akanwa kaguma, ntyo babà nka Nyamuzinda ye bakola batumuzize. <verse eid="JOB 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4"/>Erhi balya bâbo basharhu babà bali bashambâza Ayubu, Elihu arhangibalekera oluhyà, bulya bo bâli bamukulîre. <verse eid="JOB 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5"/>Ci, erhi Elihu acîbona ntâko bacishuzize Ayubu, oburhè bwajà oku bundi. <verse eid="JOB 32:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6"/>Go mango Elihu mwene Barakeli, muburhwa w’e Buzi, acîhâga oluhyà, aderha, erhi: «Omurhondêro gw’ebinwa bya Elihu Ndi nwâna wa cirhabà, na ninyu mukola muli bashosi, n’obwôba bwarhumire ntacishomya, okumubwîra oku mbwîne. <verse eid="JOB 32:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7"/>“Namâcîkêbwa nti maburhwa rhwashimba, Nti obûnji bw’emyâka bwo bwamanyîsa obushinganyanya”. <verse eid="JOB 32:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8"/>“Ci namacîbonera oku iroho ly’omuntu erhi Mûka gwa Nyamubâho, byône byankajira omuntu munya-bukengêre bunji”. <verse eid="JOB 32:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9"/>“Obûnji bw’emyâka arhali bwo burhimanya, ciru n’obushosi burhankahindula omuntu mushinganyanya”. <verse eid="JOB 32:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10"/>“Nâni, mmulalisirage nti muntege amarhwîri, bulya nâni nkolaga nayâlagaza obwâmi bumanye”. <verse eid="JOB 32:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11"/>“Kuhika mwa kano kasanzi nacikâg’ilînda ebinwa binyu, nalintezire amarhwîri nti nyumvîrhize engerêrezo zinyu, erhi na ngasi muguma adwîrhe alongereza ebi ashuza”. <verse eid="JOB 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12"/>“Nalintegêrîre ene mukaz’iderha na buno oku mwashubishuza, ci kwônene ntâye nabwîne agânya Ayubu omu nderho zâge, ntâye muli mwe walahîre ebi anashambalaga”. <verse eid="JOB 32:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13"/>“Mumanye mwankaderha, erhi: Rhwayumvîrhe lêro oburhimanya, ebi rhuyêmêra bibà bya bunyamuzinda ci birhali bya bumuntu”» <verse eid="JOB 32:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14"/>Niehe arhali ntyo ko nankajizire, nali nashuza Ayubu omu bindi binwa. <verse eid="JOB 32:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15"/>Bôhe bamaduma, ntà ishuzo ciru n’eliguma, bamabula obuderhe. <verse eid="JOB 32:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16"/>Nâni namâlingûzagya lêro namâbona ntâye ocidesire kanwa, Boshi bahwekêra, kuziga erhi n’ebinwa byabahwêrîre. <verse eid="JOB 32:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17"/>Nâni nkolaga nacîheba eluhya, nyâlagaze obwâmi bumanye. <verse eid="JOB 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18"/>Bulya nyunjwire binwa, bibirindisirwe n’omûka gumbamwo. <verse eid="JOB 32:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19"/>Omurhima gwâni kwo gunali nk’idivayi lyalingihôngolwa, lidwîrhe lyabirabira, n’okulonz’ibûndula orhubindi rhuhyâhya. <verse eid="JOB 32:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20"/>Ka nderhage nâni, lyo ntîmûkwa! nabumbûla akanwa mpâne ishuzo. <verse eid="JOB 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21"/>Ntalondôle ciru n’omuntu muguma, ntaderhe nti oyu ye nayinginga. <verse eid="JOB 32:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22"/>Cabà! Nie wa bene ntishi oku balimîrhiza, rhinga owandemaga mîra antingamiraga.<verse eid="JOB 32:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33"/>
  <para style="s1">Obwikubagire bwa Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1"/>Wâni Ayubu, yumva ezi nderho zâni, rhega okurhwiri kuli ebi binwa. <verse eid="JOB 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2"/>Lolà oku nabumbûla akanwa, n’oku olulimi lwâni lwamarhenga ebiraka mpu lushambâle. <verse eid="JOB 33:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3"/>Omurhima gwâni gwamâdubukamwo ebinwa by’obushinganyanya, n’akanwa kâni karharhengemwo ebirhali bya kukubûla, <verse eid="JOB 33:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4"/>Mûka gwa Nyamuzinda gwandemaga, Mûka gw’Ogala-byoshi gumpa akalamo. <verse eid="JOB 33:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5"/>Akabà wankahash’okunshuza, wananshuza nâni, oyimange embere zâni, oderhe okwâwe omanyire. <verse eid="JOB 33:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6"/>Lolà oku ndi akâwe, ntali Nyamuzinda, nâni nalemagwa omu budaka akâwe. <verse eid="JOB 33:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7"/>Okwo kwanarhuma omucûkà gwâni gurhakujugumya, n’okuboko omanye kwankakuzidohera, bulya ntalimwo bugalu. <verse eid="JOB 33:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8"/>Kurhi kulya nayumvîrhe amarhwîri gâni gahema, bulya nayumvîrhe omulenge gw’izù lyâwe, <verse eid="JOB 33:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9"/>Niono ndi mwêru kwêru ntà bulyâlya, ndi mwimâna, buzira izâbyo. <verse eid="JOB 33:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10"/>Ci kwône kushobeka anshobesire, anakola ali andola nka mushombanyi wâge. <verse eid="JOB 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11"/>Amalîra amagulu gâni omu byûma, n’okujà kwalongereza ngasi hoshi nankagera. <verse eid="JOB 33:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12"/>Kuli ebyo byoshi nkubwîzire oku oyâzire, bulya Nyamuzinda arhalusire omuntu. <verse eid="JOB 33:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13"/>Cankarhuma wamulonza kw’akadali, mpu kwenge arhali akushuza cinwa oku cinwa? <verse eid="JOB 33:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14"/>Nyamuzinda ajira mbero nyinji za binwa, buzira omuntu okukengukwa. <verse eid="JOB 33:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15"/>Omu bilôrho na muli ngasi biyishira omuntu budufu, nk’obôba bwamârhûnga ebiremwa, oku ncîngo zâbo; <verse eid="JOB 33:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16"/>Go mango abaderhera omu marhwiri, ababwîre amahwe, abadirhimanye n’enshusho z’ebibonekana. <verse eid="JOB 33:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17"/>Ly’ahugîsa omuntu obushanja bwâge, n’okunyihya oku bucîbone bwâge. <verse eid="JOB 33:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18"/>Ntyo anamucinge, omûka gwâge gulek’irhogera emuhengere, Obuzîne bwâge bulekihirigirha n’okuj’omu nyenga. <verse eid="JOB 33:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19"/>N’okulumwa kunayigirize omuntu nako, amango orhuvuha rhwâge rhugera mw’omusisi. <verse eid="JOB 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20"/>Omuntu anayumve omugati gwamâmushologorha, ayumve arhagwêrhi mîru ga kulya enyama. <verse eid="JOB 33:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21"/>Kuhika omubiri gwâge guje gwayumîrira, abone amavuha garhaboneka gayâlagale. <verse eid="JOB 33:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22"/>Nk’omûka gwâge gukola guyêrekîre ekuzimu, n’obuzîne bwâge bukola buyêrekîre ekuzimu, <verse eid="JOB 33:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23"/>Muli ago mango erhi hankayisha malahika, mufungizi muguma okûzirwe omu cihumbi, owankabwiriza omuntu ebi akwânîne okujira. <verse eid="JOB 33:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24"/>Owafa omuntu bwônjo amuderhere erhi: «Omubabalire arhajaga ekuzimu, nabwîne ecayôkola obuzîne bwâge!» <verse eid="JOB 33:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25"/>Aho, omubiri gwâge gwamâshubibona obuzibu bw’eburhô, anashubire omu mango gâge g’obusole. <verse eid="JOB 33:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26"/>Anahûna Nyamuzinda anayumvûbwe, anakaz’ilolêreza obusù bwâge n’enshagali, anayâlize oku n’omuntu agwêrhe obushinganya, <verse eid="JOB 33:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27"/>Omuntu anaj’ayîmba embere z’abandi bantu, erhi: «Nalinjizire okubî, nalimbuzire obushinganyanya, Yêhe arhangaluliraga nk’oku obubî bwâni bwalishingânîne». <verse eid="JOB 33:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28"/>Alanzire omûka gwâni oku lufù, n’akalamo kâni kayishibona obulangashane. <verse eid="JOB 33:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29"/>Lolà oku kwo Nyamuzinda ajirira omuntu ntyo, liguma, kabirhi, ciru n’akasharhu. <verse eid="JOB 33:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30"/>Okwôla mpu ly’arhenza omûka gwâge omu lufù, mpu ly’omuntu amolekerwa n’obulangashane bw’abazîne. <verse eid="JOB 33:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31"/>Orhege okurhwiri wâni Ayubu, onyumve, ohulike nie nkolaga naderha. <verse eid="JOB 33:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32"/>Akabà ogwêrhe ebinwa by’okushuza oderhage, bulya nanasima nyêrekane obushinganyanya bwâwe; <verse eid="JOB 33:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33"/>Akabà nanga, Ohulikage nkola nakuyumvîsa obumanye.<verse eid="JOB 33:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34"/>
  <para style="s1">Elihu ayûshûla ebindi binwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1"/>Okubundi Elihu ayûshûla aderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2"/>Ninyu mwe bashinganyanya, yumvi ebi binwa, mwe b’obumanye bunji, muntege okurhwiri. <verse eid="JOB 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3"/>Bulya okurhwiri kurhahimwa kurhonya enshambâlo, Nka kula ebiraka biyumva amanyunya g’ebiryo. <verse eid="JOB 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4"/>Rhulolage haguma bihi biri bya bushinganyanya, rhwêne na nene rhulole ebiri by’okuli. <verse eid="JOB 34:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5"/>Ayubu anadesire, erhi: «Mbà mushinganyanya, na Nyamuzinda àmbulîre okuli kwâni, <verse eid="JOB 34:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6"/>Omutwî w’emmanja (wâni) kuli nie ali mwîsi wa bantu, obubî bwâni kakola kafinjo karhafuma, n’obwo ntâbyo najizire» <verse eid="JOB 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7"/>Ngahi oli aka Ayubu akaciboneka? Onywa amabî nka mîshi. <verse eid="JOB 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8"/>Ogenda haguma n’abanya-byâha, Oyumvîkana n’abantu babî. <verse eid="JOB 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9"/>Karhali yêne waderhaga, erhi: «Bici kukwânana omuntu, omu kujira ebi alonzize, omu bwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda». <verse eid="JOB 34:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10"/>Munyumve nâni nka muntu mugumagumà, muyegûle kulî na Nyamuzinda amagalugalu; Ow’eyanya abà mushinganyanya. <verse eid="JOB 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11"/>Bulya ahemba omuntu nk’oku ebijiro byâge binali, alola ngasi muntu oku obwôrhere bwâge bunali. <verse eid="JOB 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12"/>Kwo binali Nyamuzinda arhabà nkola-maligo, Nyamubâho arhalenganya. <verse eid="JOB 34:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13"/>Ndi wamuhâga obuhashe burhegeka igulu? Ndi wankamubwizire mpu arhegeke igulu lyoshi? <verse eid="JOB 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14"/>Acîshubiranaga omûka gwâge, acicîbungiragakwo yênene empûsi yâge. <verse eid="JOB 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15"/>Ngasi ciremwa coshi cànkahubire, n’omuntu ashubire omu katulo. <verse eid="JOB 34:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16"/>Akabà oyîsh’iyumvîrhiza, ohire ehi emurhima: orhege okurhwiri oku mulenge gw’izù lyâni. <verse eid="JOB 34:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17"/>K’oshomba obushinganyanya anamany’irhegeka? K’anacîshomya mpu atwira Omushinganyanya Ogala-byoshi olubanja? <verse eid="JOB 34:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18"/>Obwîra abâmi mpu: «ntindi!» ogayaguza abaluzi. <verse eid="JOB 34:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19"/>Arhishi baluzi, arhanajira kabôlo ekarhî k’omugaraganda n’entagengwa, bulya boshi buli bulenga bw’enfune zâge. <verse eid="JOB 34:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20"/>Boshi kufà bafà omu kahwenyenye k’obudufu, entwâli ziherêrekere n’okuhirigirha, na ciri-misî amunaganule buzira kucihinya. <verse eid="JOB 34:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21"/>Amasù gâge garhahwa garhasingiriza enjira z’omuntu, n’okulolêreza amakano gâge. <verse eid="JOB 34:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22"/>Ntà mwizimya nîsi erhi lwikûngu, nyankola-maligo ankahash’icîfulikamwo. <verse eid="JOB 34:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23"/>Ntâye alâliza mpu ly’abonekana mushinganyanya omu masù ga Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="JOB 34:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24"/>Yêne ye vunyungula abanya-buhashe buzira kudôsibwa na ndi, ahîre n’abandi ahâli h’abo. <verse eid="JOB 34:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25"/>Abà amanyirire ebijiro bya ngasi baguma! anababulindike omu budufu n’okubalabarhanya. <verse eid="JOB 34:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26"/>Nka kula kwa banya-nkola-maligo, anabavunyungulire omu masù g’olubaga. <verse eid="JOB 34:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27"/>Bulya bàmugomîre, barhanashimbaga enjira zâge. <verse eid="JOB 34:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28"/>Balibuza omukenyi kuhika emirenge yâge yamuhikako, bamugayîsa ntyo erhi ayumva endûlù z’abîrhôhye. <verse eid="JOB 34:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29"/>Erhi ankabêra burhahinya na ntâye wamuhuliganya, erhi ankabwîkira obusù bwâge, buzira kuciyêreka ndi, erhi anababalire amashanja n’ebiremwa! <verse eid="JOB 34:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30"/>Anaciza omugoma omu kasirha k’amaligo, <verse eid="JOB 34:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31"/>Erhi oyo ankabwîra Nyamuzinda, erhi: «Nagomire, ntakacijira câha, <verse eid="JOB 34:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32"/>akabà nahabire, ombabalire, akabà nabuzire obushinganyanya, ntakacishubirira» <verse eid="JOB 34:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33"/>K’oku bwâwe, anali wa kuhana, bulya walahîre emihigo yâge? Wêne wacîshoga arhali nie, nîrhu orhuhage oku bwâwe bumanye! <verse eid="JOB 34:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34"/>Ci kwône abantu barhimanya, na ngasi mugula odwîrhe anyumvîrhiza, banambwîra, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 34:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35"/>«Ayubu arhaderha n’obumanye, bulya enshambâlo yâge erhali mwo bukengêre. <verse eid="JOB 34:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36"/>“Nâwe wêne oj’emulôndôlo, oyumvîrhize amashuzo gâge n’ag’abahalanjisi”. <verse eid="JOB 34:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37"/>“Bulya amâyûshûla oku câha câge, obugoma, asherêza okuli ekarhî kîrhu, anayûshûla ebinwa birhankasîmisa Nnâmahanga.”»<verse eid="JOB 34:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda ashîbirira emikolo y’abantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1"/>Elihu ashubiyûshûla ebinwa aderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 35:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2"/>«K’ocîkebirwe mpu wanayâza, nîsi erhi ohamagale n’obwâlagale oku wanabà, mushinganyanya omu masù ga Nyamuzinda.» <verse eid="JOB 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3"/>Okucîshomya okumubwîra, erhi: «Makwânane maci kuli mwe, nkajira ecâha erhi ntacijiziri?» <verse eid="JOB 35:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4"/>Lêro niene nkolaga nakushuza, nshuze n’abîra bâwe caligumiza, <verse eid="JOB 35:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5"/>Galamira emalunga ocîbonere, Lolà kurhi ebitù biri kulî na nâwe! <verse eid="JOB 35:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6"/>Okajira ecâha, k’erhi Ye obabazize? Okayûshûla obugoma bwâwe, k’omubabazize? <verse eid="JOB 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7"/>Akabà oli mushinganyanya bici omulerhera? Nîsi bici omushobôza? <verse eid="JOB 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8"/>Obubî bwâwe bwanabalaza balya mushushine mweshi, obushinganyanya bwâwe burhankakwânana abarhali bantu. <verse eid="JOB 35:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9"/>Abâli omu malibuko, barhahwa kuyâma, Abâli omu mazibu g’ababisha, banayâkûze, bahûne owabalikûza, <verse eid="JOB 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10"/>Ci ntâye oderha, erhi: «Ngahi oli Nyamuzinda, Mulemi wâni?» Olya ohà abantu enyimbo z’obukuze budufu, <verse eid="JOB 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11"/>Olya orhuyigîriza bwinjà kulusha aleke ensimba z’erubala, Orhujira binjà na bîrhonzi kulusha aleke enyunyi z’emalunga. <verse eid="JOB 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12"/>Banayâme arhanabayumve, erhi bucibune bwa bantu babî burhuma <verse eid="JOB 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13"/>Nyamuzinda arhayumvîrhiza ebinwa bibî, Ogala-byoshi arhabilolakwo. <verse eid="JOB 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14"/>Woyo wamacishomya okuderha, erhi «Ntamubwîni» mpu olubanja lwâni luli emwâge, nalinda! <verse eid="JOB 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15"/>Nîsi, erhi: «Oburhè bwâge burhahana» anali nk’ohabire obubî bw’ebinwa by’omuntu. <verse eid="JOB 35:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16"/>Kuli kuderha oku Ayubu adwîrhe abumbûlira akanwa busha, omu buhwinja bwâge adwîrhe aluza ebinwa busha.<verse eid="JOB 35:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36"/>
  <para style="s1">Amakwânane g’amalibuko g’Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1"/>Okubundi Elihu anacigendekera aderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2"/>Oninde hisungunu onandeke nkuyigîrize, bulya ntadesire byoshi ebiyêrekîre Nyamuzinda! <verse eid="JOB 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3"/>Nadòma obumanye bwâni kulî, lyo nfungira Omulemi wâni <verse eid="JOB 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4"/>Bulya okunali ebinwa byâni birhali bya bunywesi, biri binwa byàli hôfi nâwe, bya muntu ogwêrhe obumanye nkana. <verse eid="JOB 36:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5"/>Nyamuzinda arhakabulira omuntu ogwêrhe omurhima gucîre! <verse eid="JOB 36:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6"/>Arhankaziga omuntu mubî alama, ye fungira abakenyi, <verse eid="JOB 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7"/>Ye yeza omushinganyanya, anamudamaze oku ntebe y’obwâmi haguma n’abâmi, omu irenge ly’ensiku n’amango! <verse eid="JOB 36:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8"/>Lêro abashwêke n’obudagulè, balibuzibwe n’amalumwa. <verse eid="JOB 36:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9"/>Abamanyise ntyo ebijiro byâbo, abayêreke ebijiro by’obucîbone bwâbo! <verse eid="JOB 36:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10"/>Abayigule amarhwîri abarhônde, mpu baleke obubî bwâbo. <verse eid="JOB 36:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11"/>Erhi bankanayumva bakanamurhumikira, akalamo kâbo banakagereza omu murhûla n’emyâka yâbo ebè ya masîma. <verse eid="JOB 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12"/>Ci erhi ankabà barhayumva, bônene banaciyîsa n’itumu, bafè barhanamanyiri. <verse eid="JOB 36:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13"/>Ci ab’emirhima mizibu, balya bakaziyôrha bali omu burhè, barhankamanya bayâkûza amango amabashwêka. <verse eid="JOB 36:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14"/>Banafà omu busole bwâbo, n’akalamo kâbo kagayaguzibwe. <verse eid="JOB 36:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15"/>Anayôkole omukenyi n’obukenyi bwâge, anamuyigîrize n’amalumwa. <verse eid="JOB 36:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16"/>Nâwe alonza akukûle omu burhè, akuhîre aha wagandâza! <verse eid="JOB 36:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17"/>Wàlahire okuhà abantu babî obuhane, wakaz’iyîma enfûzi obuhashe bwâyo. <verse eid="JOB 36:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18"/>Ci ocîlangage omanye ebinji-binji byakushumika kubî, wankahera n’obuhirhi bunene. <verse eid="JOB 36:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19"/>Otwîre omugale olubanja kuguma n’omukenyi, omuntu muzibu kuguma n’omuntu muzâmba. <verse eid="JOB 36:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20"/>Orhavunyungulaga ababûnga, mpu lyo ohà bene winyu entebe zâbo; <verse eid="JOB 36:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21"/>Omanye wankahabukira omu birhashingânîni, byo byàrhumaga ojà omu marhangulo gali nk’aga. Olwimbo lw’obushinganyanya buzibu <verse eid="JOB 36:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22"/>Lolà oku Nyamuzinda ye jira obuhashe bwoshi, muntu mukulu ndi wankacigerera kuli Ye? <verse eid="JOB 36:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23"/>Ndi okola omulangwîre enjira agereramwo? Ndi okola omubwizire, erhi: «Wajizire kubî». <verse eid="JOB 36:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24"/>Okuli kulenga, olonze kurhi wankakuza omukolo gwâwe, ogu abantu bakuza n’enyimbo zâbo. <verse eid="JOB 36:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25"/>Abagubona basômerwe, omuntu akazigulolêreza ciru akabà ali kulî <verse eid="JOB 36:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26"/>Nêci Nyamuzinda ali mukulu, alushire obumanye bwîrhu, omubalè gw’emyâka yâge gurhankaheka! <verse eid="JOB 36:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27"/>Ye nyihya emirhônyi y’amîshi, ayijire ebè nkuba, cihonzi cinene. <verse eid="JOB 36:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28"/>Nêci ebitù bibulage, ehûngukire oku rhutù rhw’abantu. <verse eid="JOB 36:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29"/>Ndi wankahash’imanya kurhi ebitù bigenda, ndi wankamanya emikungulo y’omu mwâge? <verse eid="JOB 36:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30"/>Lolà oku analambûlire ebitù oku nyanya z’entondo, abikolêse omu kucibwîkira. <verse eid="JOB 36:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31"/>Kwa bene okwo kw’aluza mw’abantu, n’okuhâna ebiryo mwandu. <verse eid="JOB 36:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32"/>Anafumbarhe omulazo omu nfune zâge, anagubwîre eci gwakola. <verse eid="JOB 36:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33"/>Omukungulo gwâge gunamanyise oku ayiruka, oku obukunizi bwâge buyishir’igandaza obubî.<verse eid="JOB 36:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1"/>Na kuli okwo, omurhima gwâni gwamâshabira omu nda, mwamârhenga aha gubêra. <verse eid="JOB 37:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2"/>Yumvi, yumvi okushakânya’kw’izù lyâge emikungulo yamurhenga omu kanwa <verse eid="JOB 37:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3"/>Yamânarhulukâna omu malunga mwoshi, n’emilazô yâge yamâlagiza kuhika ah’igulu lihekera. <verse eid="JOB 37:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4"/>Enyuma zâge izù lyakungula bwenêne, bulya izù linene lya Nyamuzinda lyakungula. Arhankanayimanza emilazô yâge amango izù lyâge lidwîrhe lyakungula. <verse eid="JOB 37:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5"/>Nêci okunali, n’eyo mikungulo, Nyamuzinda anarhuyêreke ebisômerîne, anajîre ebirhangâzo rhurhankakayumva. <verse eid="JOB 37:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6"/>Anabwîre enkuba y’olubula, erhi: «Rhogera oku idaho» n’enkuba y’ecihônzi ayibwîre, erhi: «Rhoga n’obuzibu bunene» <verse eid="JOB 37:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7"/>Ntyo anayimanze emikolo y’abantu, Lyo ngasi muguma amanyîsa-ho oku emikolo yâge eri mikulu. <verse eid="JOB 37:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8"/>N’ensimba zije omu mwâzo, ziyegeme omu malumba gâzo. <verse eid="JOB 37:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9"/>Ecihûsi carhenga aha cibà, n’empûsi y’emwênè elerhe emboho. <verse eid="JOB 37:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10"/>N’oku misî y’omûka gwa Nyamuzinda, olubula lunanage n’enyîshi zihulula zizibuhe. <verse eid="JOB 37:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11"/>Anahire omûka omu bitù, n’ebitù bihire emilazô eyi n’eyi. <verse eid="JOB 37:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12"/>Nayo emilazô yanaja emunda ayirhegesire, ejîre oku anayirhegesire omu igulu lyoshi. <verse eid="JOB 37:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13"/>Hali amango eyisha eri hana abantu, nîsi erhi elerhe aminjà g’enkuba. <verse eid="JOB 37:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14"/>Okwôla kwoshi okuyumve wâni Ayubu, buzira kurhindira, Onagerêreze oku birhangâzo bya Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="JOB 37:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15"/>K’omanyire oku Nyamuzinda abirhegeka? K’oyishi oku ajira ly’emilazô emoleka kurhenga omu bitù? <verse eid="JOB 37:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16"/>K’oyishi kurhi ajira ly’ebitù birhagirhogera oku idaho, cisômerîne c’obukengêre bwâge bunji; <verse eid="JOB 37:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17"/>Woyo, emyambalo yâwe enayunjule idûrhu, Gala mango igulu lihûmûka, lirhengemwo ehihûsi hyarheng’e mukondwè! <verse eid="JOB 37:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18"/>Ka wankamanya akâge okulambûla ebitù? N’okubizibuhya nka cilolero ca cûma? <verse eid="JOB 37:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19"/>Mbwîraga nâni kurhi rhwankamushuza? Okwinja, rhucîhulikire bulya rhuli omu mwizimya. <verse eid="JOB 37:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20"/>K’ebinwa byâni hali oku byamubwîra? Ka mwene omuntu ankamuyigîriza? <verse eid="JOB 37:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21"/>Mango maguma obulangashane burhaboneke, bulya bwabwîkîrwe bwenêne n’ebitù, Kandi empûsi yanayisha ebiyehukane kulî. <verse eid="JOB 37:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22"/>Olunda lw’e Mwênè, yamârhenga obulangashane buli nka masholo Nyamuzinda oyo ocîhundikire obukulu bw’okuyôbohya! <verse eid="JOB 37:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23"/>Ogala-byoshi, ntaho rhwankamushimâna! Ye mukulu, nn’obushinganyanya n’obuhashe! <verse eid="JOB 37:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24"/>Abantu boshi bamurhînye, bamukuze balya boshi bacikunga bwenge.<verse eid="JOB 37:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38"/>
  <para style="ms1">IV. Ebinwa bya Nyakasane kuli Ayubu</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyamulema w’oburhimanya ayagîriza Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1"/>Kurhenga omu mulaba, Nyakasane ashuza Ayubu, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 38:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2"/>Ye ndi odwîrhe acîka emihigo yâni, n’ebinwa byâge by’obuhwinja? <verse eid="JOB 38:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3"/>Hwinja! Ohwinje nka kula entwâli yankanakenyera; nakudôsa nâwe wanashuza. <verse eid="JOB 38:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4"/>Ngahi wali erhi ndema igulu? Derhaga akabà obumanye bwâwe buli bunji. <verse eid="JOB 38:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5"/>Ndi walijiriraga olubibi, erhi nîsi, ndi walilambûliragakwo omugozi? <verse eid="JOB 38:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6"/>Oku bici amakôndo gâlyo gasimikira, nîsi, erhi ndi waligwîkiraga ibuye ly’eciriba? <verse eid="JOB 38:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7"/>Omu karhî k’enyenyêzi zikemeza sêzi, na bene Nyamuzinda boshi bazanzaramuke? <verse eid="JOB 38:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8"/>Indi wahamisire enyanja n’enyumvi, amango yàjiragwa? <verse eid="JOB 38:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9"/>Amango nayihâga ebitù nti gwo mwambalo gwâyo, n’enyikungu nti zibè rhwîrhubo rhwâyo. <verse eid="JOB 38:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10"/>K’omanyire amango nayijiriraga olubibi, nanayihirakwo enyumvi n’orhukomyo? <verse eid="JOB 38:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11"/>Nanaciyibwîra, nti: ho wakazihika aha, ntà kuharhaluka, nti ho okucîguga kw’emisî yâwe kwakazihwera ahâla. <verse eid="JOB 38:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12"/>K’omu kalamo kâwe okola orhegesire obuce? K’okola oyeresire omucêracêra aha gwabêra? <verse eid="JOB 38:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13"/>Lyo bugwârhira igulu oku marhambi gâlyo, ntyo bugukumule amabî muli lyo? <verse eid="JOB 38:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14"/>Lêro igulu lyanabà n’eyindi nshusho, lihinduke nk’ibûmba lihinage libè n’elindi ibala nka mwambalo <verse eid="JOB 38:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15"/>Anayase ababî obumoleke bwâbo, avune n’amaboko galikola galengerire <verse eid="JOB 38:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16"/>K’okola ojîre kuhika aha nshôko y’enyânja, k’okola olambagîre wahika aha buzinda bw’omuhengere? <verse eid="JOB 38:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17"/>K’emihango y’obudufu k’okola oyibwîne? Ka wabwîne emihango y’ahantu h’endunduli y’olufù? <verse eid="JOB 38:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18"/>K’okola orhanyize oku bugali bw’igulu, mbwîra erhi oliyîshi lyoshi? <verse eid="JOB 38:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19"/>Ngahi obulangashane bugwîshira? Ngahi omwizimya gulâla? <verse eid="JOB 38:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20"/>Mpu obitamaze halya bibêra, erhi obiheke omu myûbako yabyo? <verse eid="JOB 38:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21"/>Okakumanya, kwo kuderha oku wali muburhe, n’obwo odwîrhe waganja nsiku nyinji kulushîsa? <verse eid="JOB 38:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22"/>K’okola ohisire aha olubula lubîkwa, aha enguli zâlwo zibêra, k’okola ohahisire? <verse eid="JOB 38:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23"/>Zo nguli mbà mbikire amango g’amalibuko, amango g’ensiku z’akadali n’ez’entambala. <verse eid="JOB 38:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24"/>Njira ehi obulangashane bulumiramwo omu igulu, Ngahi empûsi y’ebuzûka-zûba elumîra omu igulu? <verse eid="JOB 38:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25"/>Indi ojira emibûnda y’emigezi, n’enjira y’ebitù amango enkuba yakûngula? <verse eid="JOB 38:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26"/>Aniese ntyo enkuba omu cihugo cirhalimwo ndi, n’omu irungu omurhabà muntu? <verse eid="JOB 38:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27"/>N’erhi enia ntyo, ahantu hali bwâmwa hanayumûsire, ehadômerere, emeze ho ebyâsi bibishi. <verse eid="JOB 38:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28"/>K’enkuba ejira îshe ôyiburha? Indi ôburha emirhônyi y’olumè! <verse eid="JOB 38:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29"/>Ndà ehi olubula lurhengamwo Ndi ôburha ensimbu y’oku nkuba? <verse eid="JOB 38:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30"/>Gala mango amîshi gazibuha nka mabuye, na gala mango omuhengere guboneka guyashamire, <verse eid="JOB 38:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31"/>Ka wankahasha warhandânya olukere lw’enyenyêzi Kilimiya, mpu olushwêke n’omugozi, nîsi erhi okutwa emishumiro y’enyenyêzi Oriyoni. <verse eid="JOB 38:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32"/>Ka we zûsa enyenyêzi y’esêzi omu mango gâyo, nîsi erhi we gendana enyenyêzi ya Marsi n’abâna bâyo? <verse eid="JOB 38:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33"/>K’oyishi amarhegeko g’oku nkuba, ka wankahash’iderha buhashe buci gajira omu igulu? <verse eid="JOB 38:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34"/>K’onahise izù lyâwe omu bitù nka wayâma, n’amîshi gabà enyanya goshi ka ganakuyûmve? <verse eid="JOB 38:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35"/>Ka we rhegeka emilazô mpu egendage, ka enakubwîre, erhi: «Rhôno rhuli hano?» <verse eid="JOB 38:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36"/>Ndi ohà omûnânâ oburhondekezi? N’oluhazi oluhe obwenge? <verse eid="JOB 38:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37"/>Ndi wankamany’igânja ebitù n’obwenge bwâge, ndi wankahengeka orhubîndi rhw’omu malunga? <verse eid="JOB 38:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38"/>Gala mango akatulo kahinduka idaho lyûmu, na gala mango amalôngo gagwarhana, lyoki lyo? <verse eid="JOB 38:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39"/>Ka we hivira entale-nkazi omunyama wâyo, onayiguse abâna bâyo? <verse eid="JOB 38:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40"/>K’oyishi okwazo gala mango zicîlambika omu bulumba, nîsi erhi amango zicîfulisire omu ishaka? <verse eid="JOB 38:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41"/>Indi orheganyiza hungwe ebihembo, gala mango ebyâna-nyunyi byâge biyamira emunda Nyamuzinda ali, binaje byagwagwabirira ebiryo?<verse eid="JOB 38:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1"/>K’oyishi amango orhushafu rhuburha? K’okola obwîne amango rhufùmba? <verse eid="JOB 39:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2"/>Ka wankamanya myêzi inga rhuburhirakwo, nîsi erhi amango rhuburha? <verse eid="JOB 39:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3"/>Rhunashurhame rhuburhe abâna barhò, rhurhanalumwe na cici. <verse eid="JOB 39:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4"/>N’amango abâna barhò bakola bagwêrhe emisî, bamânakula, banakomogoze, banacîgendere olwâbo lunda. <verse eid="JOB 39:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5"/>Ndi wankalekaga endogomi y’erubala, mpu ekaja olunda enalonzize, indi oshwekûla endogomi y’emuzirhu? <verse eid="JOB 39:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6"/>Namuhîre obulambo nti mwo akazibêra, n’olubanda lw’omunyu mpu mwo mwâge? <verse eid="JOB 39:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7"/>Arhafuduka n’olubî lw’omu lugo, arhayumva oku endogomi y’ekà yayâna. <verse eid="JOB 39:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8"/>Anabè ageragera omwo ntondo ayabukira, aj’afukulamwo, ngasi aha ehyâsi hibishi hinali. <verse eid="JOB 39:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9"/>K’embogo yankaziga yakukolera, nîsi erhi okubera omu lugò lw’ebintu byâwe? <verse eid="JOB 39:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10"/>Ka wankahash’iyihalir’okuhinga, oyihirekwo enfuka mpu eyishe yahinga omu nyuma zâwe omu lubà nda? <verse eid="JOB 39:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11"/>Ka wankacîkubagira yo bulya yo egwêrhe emisî minene, mpu okolaga wayiyêreka emikolo oyirekere yo? <verse eid="JOB 39:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12"/>Ka wankacîkubagira-yo amango wagendisârûla emburho yâwe, n’okuyilundika oku câno câwe? <verse eid="JOB 39:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13"/>K’ecûbi c’enyunda wankacigerera oku mashala ga lubôndo nîsi erhi oku g’akadûrha? <verse eid="JOB 39:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14"/>Amango esiga amajî gâyo oku idaho, egasiga omu bidaka mpu gadurhubaliremwo. <verse eid="JOB 39:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15"/>Enayibagire oku hali okugulu kwankagasârhalakwo, Oku hali ensimba y’erubala yankagabera. <verse eid="JOB 39:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16"/>Ebà ndârhi oku bâna bâyo nka kulya oku barhali bâyo erhaderha mpu yarhamira busha. <verse eid="JOB 39:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17"/>Ali ebwa kubà Nyamuzinda àyiyîmire oburhondekezi, arhanayihâga bukengêre bunganaci. <verse eid="JOB 39:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18"/>Ci kwônene amango yamâcîrhunika, enalushe enfarasi n’oyigendakwo. <verse eid="JOB 39:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19"/>Ka we hà enfarasi emisî yâyo, Ka we wayitâkaga n’omugâra gw’obushênzi omu igosi? <verse eid="JOB 39:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20"/>Ka we rhuma yacanuka nka luzige, n’okuyâna kulya kw’okuyôbohya? <verse eid="JOB 39:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21"/>Enaje yacijanjaga omu kabanda, n’oburhwâli enacîhunike omu ntambala. <verse eid="JOB 39:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22"/>Erhafà bôba, erharhînya cici, erhashubira nyuma embere ly’engôrho. <verse eid="JOB 39:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23"/>Enyanya lyâyo wanayumva empenzi yajegera, obone n’oku itumu n’omwampi byayisha byalaza. <verse eid="JOB 39:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24"/>Nka yamâjunjugurhwa n’okulinda, enakûle omulindi, elibirhe okurhalusire, erhankacilindirira nk’omushekera gwamâvuga. <verse eid="JOB 39:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25"/>Ngasi kubûha omushekera, enabè nk’erhali kwo ihuzi-huzi; oku guciri kuli enayeheze entambala, okuhagaza kw’abarhambo n’orhuhababo rhw’amatabâro. <verse eid="JOB 39:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26"/>Ka bukengêre bwâwe burhuma lubaka ayêrêr’emalunga, n’okulambûlira ebyûbi byâge olunda lw’emukondwè? <verse eid="JOB 39:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27"/>K’irhegeko lyâwe lirhuma ikozi lyazimêra emalunga? Ka lyo lirhuma lyagend’irhêrera oku nyanya ly’entondo? <verse eid="JOB 39:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28"/>Oku mabuye liyûbaka, kwo linalâla, oku luhande lw’ibuye halya lirhankahikwâkwo. <verse eid="JOB 39:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29"/>Oku linali aho erhi lyanayunjayunja omunyama gwâlyo, amasù gâlyo gahike kulî bwenêne. <verse eid="JOB 39:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30"/>Abâna-nyunyi bâlyo banacihagûle omukò, ahâli omurhûmba erhi ho nalyo linali.<verse eid="JOB 39:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamubâho akalihira Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1"/>Nyakasane anacikalihira Ayubu amubwîra, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 40:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2"/>Olya oderha mpu ajà lubanja bône Nyamuzinda Ogala-byoshi, aderhage ebyâge naye buno! <verse eid="JOB 40:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3"/>Okubundi Ayubu anacishuza Nyakasane, aderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 40:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4"/>Ntarhanyize kuli ebi naderhaga, bicigi nankacishuza? Namâhira enfune oku kanwa kâni. <verse eid="JOB 40:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5"/>Nadesire obw’oburhanzi, Ntaciderha kabirhi. Nyamuzinda ye hima emisî y’obubî <verse eid="JOB 40:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6"/>Okubundi, kurhenga omu milazô, Nyakasane anacishuza Ayubu, amubwîra, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 40:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7"/>Ohwinje onakobeke kirumè, nakudôsa nâwe onshuze. <verse eid="JOB 40:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8"/>Ka walonza okugayaguza oku nahizire, onyime olubanja mpu ly’ocîhà lwo? <verse eid="JOB 40:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9"/>Ka ogwêrhe okuboko kw’obu-nyamuzinda? K’izù lyâwe lidwîrhe lyakungula ak’eryâge? <verse eid="JOB 40:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10"/>Ojâge aho ocîhundikire obukulu n’obuhashe, ohwinje obumoleke n’irenge! <verse eid="JOB 40:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11"/>Yêrekanaga oburhè bwâwe, n’isù lyâwe likali lihunyange obucîbone. <verse eid="JOB 40:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12"/>Omôlage isù lyâwe, abacîbona boshi bayubîze, oherêrekeze ho na ho abîsi. <verse eid="JOB 40:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13"/>Kanyagya obabishe boshi mbirindikanye ekuzimu, nîsi, erhi obashwêkere boshi omu mpamikwa. <verse eid="JOB 40:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14"/>Lêro aho nanabà wa burhanzi omu kukukuza, ebwa kubà wamaciha olukengwa omu kuhima kwâwe. Olw’emvubu <verse eid="JOB 40:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15"/>Orhengilolereza emvubu, ciremwa câni akâwe, kukera ekera obuhasi nka nkâfu. <verse eid="JOB 40:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16"/>Lolà misî minganaci ejira omu mabùnda bulà buzibu bw’emisî eyibà oku nda! <verse eid="JOB 40:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17"/>Anashungulike omucira gwâge gubè muzibu nka ndûndu, amahiji gâge goshi bayunjwîre bikanyi bizongobarhîne. <verse eid="JOB 40:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18"/>Amavuha gâge gali nka misiho ya byûma, n’ebikângakânga byâge biri nka byûma by’eruganda. <verse eid="JOB 40:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19"/>Abà bushanja bulemêrera bwa Nyamuzinda, ci owamulemaga kurharhuma arhamuyômolera engôrho. <verse eid="JOB 40:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20"/>Buhasi bw’omu ntondo alya, mulya ezindi nsimba zishârhira. <verse eid="JOB 40:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21"/>Omu lushâsha alâla, acibwalike omu mahukulu g’amasheke omu luziba. <verse eid="JOB 40:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22"/>Enfinjo zinamucikirize n’ecihoho câzo, emiyêrêzi y’oku nyîshi enamuzunguluke ehurhambi.; <verse eid="JOB 40:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23"/>Olwîshi erhi lwankayunjula yêhe arhankayôboha cici, Ciru okuli nka nyamwîshi Yordani lwankadârhabala kurhi, yêhe arhankahuligana. <verse eid="JOB 40:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24"/>Indi wankaderha mpu amugwârhira emalanga, mpu amurhule amazûlu ahiremw’omugozi. <verse eid="JOB 40:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 40:25"/>Ka wankamuloba n’olulobo, n’okumushwêka olulimi n’omugozi <verse eid="JOB 40:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 40:26"/>Ka wankamugeza omuguguna omu mazûlu, nîsi erhi wankamurhûla amarhama gâge n’omugera. <verse eid="JOB 40:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 40:27"/>Ka ankakuyinginga, n’okukushambâza n’ebinwa by’olubohôlolo? <verse eid="JOB 40:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 40:28"/>Ka wankanywâna mweshi naye, Ly’ayôrha mujà wâwe ensiku zoshi? <verse eid="JOB 40:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 40:29"/>Ka wankamushwêka kula bashasa akanyunyi ka wankamushwêka mpu wakazisîmîsamwo abâna bâwe? <verse eid="JOB 40:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 40:30"/>K’abashâna bankacîhira haguma mpu bayish’imuguza? K’abarhunzi bankaderha mpu bamulya mwenda? <verse eid="JOB 40:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 40:31"/>Ka wankarhulungula oluhù lwâge n’ebisônga, nîsi erhi okumuhombôla irhwe n’ecihômbo? <verse eid="JOB 40:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 40:32"/>Orhang’iderha mpu wacîshomya omulwîse, Hano okengera oku akujizire, orhankacishubiriza!<verse eid="JOB 40:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1"/>Obulangâlire bwâwe bwanashuba bwa bishuki, bulya erhi wankamubadukirakwo konene erhi kunakola kufuduka! <verse eid="JOB 41:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2"/>Anahinduke Nyabukalye erhi hankajira owamutula irò, ntâye wankashîngalala embere zâge. <verse eid="JOB 41:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3"/>Ndi wankaderha mpu amulwîsa abule n’oku abîre? Ntâye ciru n’omuguma hano igulu lyoshi! <verse eid="JOB 41:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4"/>Naderha n’oku biyêrekîre ebirûmbu byâge, nashambâla n’oku misî yâge erhankagerwa, <verse eid="JOB 41:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5"/>Ndi okola olengezize omuhiro gw’oluhugurhu lwâge? Ndi okola ohisire omu bongobana bw’olubôngo lwâge? <verse eid="JOB 41:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6"/>Ndi okola obumbwîre emiromo y’akanwa kâge Oku ajira ecôbà omu kulola olukere lw’amîno gâge! <verse eid="JOB 41:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7"/>Omugôngo gwâge nka mpenzi zihêkîne, zishwêkîrwe haguma n’obulêmbo buzibu. <verse eid="JOB 41:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8"/>Ngasi igâmba lihisire oku lindi, emboho erhankagugeramwo. <verse eid="JOB 41:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9"/>Gali gashwêkîne gwoshi haguma, gamuyôrhekwo mubûmbuli gurhankabûngûka. <verse eid="JOB 41:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10"/>Akayasamura, ensasi z’omuliro zinacîkwêbe, n’amasù gâge gali nka ngohe za mucêracêra. <verse eid="JOB 41:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11"/>Omu kanwa kâge munakaz’irhenga endimi z’omuliro, munakaz’iyômoka emitulika y’omuliro. <verse eid="JOB 41:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12"/>Omu mazûlu gâge cigî citumbûkamwo, ciri nka cira cirhenga omu nyungu y’amaboyôngoka. <verse eid="JOB 41:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13"/>Omûka gwâge gunayôce nk’isêse, omu kanwa kâge munakêrhenga engulumira y’omuliro <verse eid="JOB 41:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14"/>Emisî yâge omu igosi ebêra, embere zâge eri côbà ca kujugumya. <verse eid="JOB 41:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15"/>Ebikanyi n’enyama zâge byoshi bigwârhîne kuli ye, byoshi biciniolîre kuli ye birhankanahuligana. <verse eid="JOB 41:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16"/>Omurhima gwâge guli muzibu nk’ibuye, muzibu-zibu nka lwanjikwa. <verse eid="JOB 41:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17"/>Erhi azûka, amîshi ganadirhimane, amîshi g’enyanja ganaciyêngûle. <verse eid="JOB 41:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18"/>Bakaderha mpu bamufunda engôrho, erhamurhulukânamwo oli itumu, oli ecisonga, byo hâhè. <verse eid="JOB 41:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19"/>Ecûma embere zâge kwo ciri nka hirhi. n’ecûma c’amarhale nka murhi gwalunzirwe. <verse eid="JOB 41:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20"/>Omwampi gw’omuherho gurhankamuyôbohya, ibuye ly’omu mujareti lirhamudûnda! <verse eid="JOB 41:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21"/>Akarhi k’obuhiri kuli ye kali nka lukere, anakazinzânw’akabona omwampi gwashungûrha. <verse eid="JOB 41:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22"/>Enda yâge eyunjwîre magamba ga mabandano, ko eyôrha nka kula bankahangira engembe haguma. <verse eid="JOB 41:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23"/>Anadogomye omudubwî nka ciyûngu cideke, enyanja wanamanya mpu nkaba bukù bayôkeramwo. <verse eid="JOB 41:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24"/>Omu nyuma zâge anasigemwo obuyenjule buli nka kamole, omuhengere guyòrhc nka kulya gwamâyunjula olôya lwêru. <verse eid="JOB 41:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25"/>Ntà bindi birhangâzo biri nk’ebyo hano igulu, bulya àlemirwe buzira kubà na côbà cici. <verse eid="JOB 41:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26"/>Anakazilola n’ecisûli oku ab’obucîbone bahindagala embere zâge, Yêne Mwâmi dôka wa bene-cibonè.<verse eid="JOB 41:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42"/>
  <para style="s1">Ishuzo lizinda lya Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1"/>Obwo Ayubu anacishuza Nyamubâho, aderha, erhi: <verse eid="JOB 42:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2"/>Mmanyire oku Oli Ogala-byoshi, n’omuhigo gwâwe wanahash’iguyunjuza. <verse eid="JOB 42:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3"/>Anali nie olya wakazâg’ihira akavango omu mihigo yâwe, n’ebinwa birhagwêrhi nda na mugongo; Nanashambîre buzira bukengêre, oku bintu bintalusire n’ebi ntankayumva. <verse eid="JOB 42:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4"/>(Yumvagya, nkusengîre, Woliha, ompè nâni oluhyà nderhe, nakudôsa ombwirize nâni). <verse eid="JOB 42:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5"/>Niono ntakuyishigi kundi okurhali kw’emihwalenge y’abantu omu nshambâlo zâbo, Ci lêro nâni, buno amasù gâni gamâkulolakwo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">42, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Arhali kubona n’amasù g’omubiri, ci omu buyêmêre: <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 33:20">Lub 33, 20</ref></char> + amumanya buhyâhya. </char></note>. <verse eid="JOB 42:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6"/>Na kandi omu byanshonyi byâni, namâgalula oku naderhaga, nkola nacîyûnjuza omu kucibêrera omu katulo n’omu luvù.<verse eid="JOB 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">V. Ishwinjiro</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyamubâho atumuza balya bîra basharhu ba Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7"/>Erhi ayûs’ishambâla boshi na Ayubu, Nyakasane anacibwîra Elifazi w’e Temani, erhi: «Oburhè bwâni buli bunene kuli we n’oku bìra bâwe oku banali bombi, ebwa kubà murhashambîre bwinjà oku binyêrekîre, nk’oku mwambali wâni Ayubu anajiraga. <verse eid="JOB 42:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8"/>“Muyankage bo na buno mpanzi nda na ngandabuzi nda, mukanye muj’emunda omurhumisi wâni Ayubu àli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">42, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayubu amâbà wa kusengerera abandi erhi kulembera amalumwa kurhuma: <char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 22:30">22, 30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 14:20">Eze 14, 20</ref></char>. </char></note>. Murherekêre eyo nterekêro, oku mwambali wâni Ayubu amuhûnira obwônjo. Nayîsh’irhânya kuli ye, na ntyo ntacimuhanire kuli kulya mwabulaga kushambâla bwinjà kuli nie”». <verse eid="JOB 42:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9"/>Elifazi w’e Temani, Bildadi w’e Shwahi, na Sofari w’e Nâmati, bagenda bagend’ijira kulya Nyakasane ànababwîraga; ntyo Nyakasane ababà bwônjo erhi Ayubu orhuma. Nyamubâho agalulira Ayubu obuhirhi bwâge. <verse eid="JOB 42:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10"/>Ago mango Ayubu akazâg’isengerera abîra bâge, Nyakasane ashubiyinjihya akalamo kâge. Obwo, anamugalulira kabirhi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">42, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amugalulira kabirhî: <char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 8:7">8, 7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 30:3-5">Lush 30, 3-5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 90:15">Lul 90, 15</ref></char>. </char></note> kulusha obuhirhi bwâge bwo <verse eid="JOB 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11"/>Okubundi ashub’ibona bene wâbo, bâli bâbo boshi n’abîra bâge b’embere boshi bayishiyagalukira emunda ali. Bakaz’ilîra boshi haguma omu nyumpa yâge. Boshi bakazimulakira n’okumurhûliriza, kuli agwo malumwa goshi Nyakasane àlimurhumîre. Ngasi muguma akazimusholôlera: ow’enfaranga n’ow’ehigôndo hy’amasholo. <verse eid="JOB 42:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12"/>Nyakasane anacigisha ako kalamo kazinda ka Ayubu kulusha akarhanzi: ashwêka bibuzi bihumbi ikumi na binni, ngamiya bihumbi ndarhu, masô cihumbi ga nkâfu na ndogomi cihumbi. <verse eid="JOB 42:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13"/>Aburha bâna rhabana nda na bâna-nyere basharhu. <verse eid="JOB 42:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14"/>Omwâli murhanzi amuyîrika izîno lya Yemima, n’owa kabirhi erya Kesiya, owa kasharhu naye amusûla erya Keren Hapuku. <verse eid="JOB 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15"/>Omu cihugo coshi murhabonekaga abandi balushire abo bâna­ nyere irânga linjà. Îshe anacibahà ecigabi oku kashambala kâge, kuguma na bashinja bâbo. <verse eid="JOB 42:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16"/>Enyuma ly’aho Ayubu àcilamire myâka igana na makumi anni, abona oku bâna b’abâna bâge, kuhika oku iburha lya kani. <verse eid="JOB 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17"/>Okubundi, Ayubu anacifà mushosi erhi amâyigurha ensiku.<verse eid="JOB 42:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42"/>
</usx>
